LoV|SCORNFUL ANALYSIS|000011061002|Farseekers Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Farseekers|000001195|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly HERNKYN unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one visible enemy unit within 12" of your unit. Friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units’ attacks that target that enemy unit have [IGNORES COVER].
