LoV|FIRST CONCERN|000010452003|Hearthfyre Arsenal – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Hearthfyre Arsenal|000001100|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, just after a Brôkhyr, Ironkin Steeljacks or Arkanyst Evaluator unit from your army has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">BRÔKHYR</span>, <span class="kwb">IRONKIN</span> <span class="kwb">STEELJACKS</span> or <span class="kwb">ARKANYST</span> <span class="kwb">EVALUATOR</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> If your unit Remained Stationary in your Movement phase this turn, it can make a Normal move.
LoV|PREVENTATIVE PURGE|000010452006|Hearthfyre Arsenal – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Hearthfyre Arsenal|000001100|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Fall Back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Brôkhyr Thunderkyn or Ironkin Steeljacks unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase. When doing so, models in your unit can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target) and each time a model in your unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.
LoV|DELAYED-FIRE ROUNDS|000010452004|Hearthfyre Arsenal – Wargear Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Hearthfyre Arsenal|000001100|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, just after a Brôkhyr, Ironkin Steeljacks or Arkanyst Evaluator unit from your army has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">BRÔKHYR</span>, <span class="kwb">IRONKIN</span> <span class="kwb">STEELJACKS</span> or <span class="kwb">ARKANYST</span> <span class="kwb">EVALUATOR</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit (excluding <span class="kwb">MONSTERS</span> and <span class="kwb">VEHICLES</span>) hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the start of your next Shooting phase, each time that enemy unit makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, roll one D6 for each model in that unit: for each 1, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds).
