ORK|PILE THROUGH|000009624003|Kaptin Killers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Kaptin Killers|000000964|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after an <span class="kwb">ORKS</span> unit from your army opens a Hatchway.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ORKS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit has the Fights First ability.
