ORK|CLOSE-RANGE DAKKA|000008366007|War Horde Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|War Horde|000000852|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ORKS</span> unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ORKS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have:<br><ul><li>[Rapid Fire 1].</li><li><u>Or:</u> If that attack already has <span class="kwb">[RAPID</span> <span class="kwb">FIRE]</span>, +1 to the value of that <span class="kwb">[RAPID</span> <span class="kwb">FIRE]</span> (e.g. <span class="kwb">[RAPID</span> <span class="kwb">FIRE</span> <span class="kwb">1]</span> becomes <span class="kwb">[RAPID</span> <span class="kwb">FIRE</span> <span class="kwb">2]</span>).</li></ul>
