ORK|GRAB IT|000011133003|Wreckas Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Wreckas|000001222|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly unengaged Breaka Boyz/Flash Gitz/Tankbustas unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">BREAKA</span> <span class="kwb">BOYZ</span>/<span class="kwb">FLASH</span> <span class="kwb">GITZ</span>/<span class="kwb">TANKBUSTAS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> <br><ul><li>Your unit can make a normal move of up to 6", and must end that move within range of an objective.</li><li>Your unit is <u>not</u> eligible to declare a charge until the end of the turn.</li></ul>
ORK|DRIVE-BY BUSTIN'|000011133002|Wreckas Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Wreckas|000001222|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Orks Transport unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ORKS</span> <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks with weapons selected for the Firing Deck ability have +1 to hit rolls.
QI|GROUND-SHAKING STRIDES|000011005002|Dominus Foebreakers Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Dominus Foebreakers|000001219|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS DOMINUS unit is selected to move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">DOMINUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has +2" <b>M</b>.
QI|FOEBREAKER FIRESTORM|000011005003|Dominus Foebreakers Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Dominus Foebreakers|000001219|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly engaged IMPERIAL KNIGHTS DOMINUS unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">DOMINUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s [BLAST] ranged attacks:<br><ul><li>Do not have <span class="kwb">[BLAST]</span>.</li><li>Have +1 <b>A</b>.</li></ul>
QI|FIRE SHOCKED|000011005004|Dominus Foebreakers Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Dominus Foebreakers|000001219|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS DOMINUS unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">DOMINUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit makes a battle-shock roll, with -1 to that <b>battle-shock roll</b>.
QI|STRENGTH FROM EXILE|000010756003|Freeblade Company – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Freeblade Company|000001145|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, if there are no other friendly units within 9" of your unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and re-roll a Wound roll of 1.
QI|NOBLE SACRIFICE|000010756002|Freeblade Company – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Freeblade Company|000001145|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can target that unit with this Stratagem even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s Deadly Demise ability inflicts mortal wounds on a D6 roll of 4+, adding 1 to the result if it is an Armiger unit, instead of only a 6.
QI|SURVIVOR OF STRIFE|000010756006|Freeblade Company – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Freeblade Company|000001145|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.
QI|POINT‑BLANK BARRAGE|000010756005|Freeblade Company – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Freeblade Company|000001145|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, when making ranged attacks with Blast weapons, models in your unit can target enemy units within Engagement Range of your unit (provided no other friendly units are also within Engagement Range of that enemy unit). In addition, until the end of the phase, your unit does not suffer the penalty to its Hit rolls for being within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, but each time a model in your unit makes an attack with a Blast weapon that targets a unit within Engagement Range of your unit, on an unmodified Hit roll of 1, your unit suffers 1 mortal wound after all of its attacks have been resolved.
QI|FLANKING MANOEUVRES|000010756007|Freeblade Company – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Freeblade Company|000001145|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Armiger unit from your army that is within 9" of one or more battlefield edges and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.
QI|FULL TILT|000010756004|Freeblade Company – Wargear Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Freeblade Company|000001145|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, if your unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6" to the Move characteristic of models in your unit, or 9" instead if your unit is an Armiger or Destrier unit.
QI|DRIVE THEM OUT!|000010498002|Gate Warden Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Gate Warden Lance|000001107|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit on your defensive line, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.
QI|TITANIC BOMBARDMENT|000010498006|Gate Warden Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Gate Warden Lance|000001107|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights Titanic unit from your army that Remained Stationary this turn, that is on your defensive line and that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 2] ability.
QI|STEADFAST SUPERIORITY|000010498004|Gate Warden Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Gate Warden Lance|000001107|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, that is on your defensive line and that has not already been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Hit roll.
QI|MARSHAL THE DEFENCE|000010498005|Gate Warden Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Gate Warden Lance|000001107|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two Imperial Knights units from your army that have not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, add 3" to the Move characteristic of models in your units.
QI|FORTRESS OF INTIMIDATION|000010498007|Gate Warden Lance – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Gate Warden Lance|000001107|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your opponent’s Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights Titanic unit from your army that is on your defensive line.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy unit selects your unit as a target of a charge, that unit must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from the result.
QI|LANCEBREAKER|000010498003|Gate Warden Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Gate Warden Lance|000001107|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks and is on your defensive line.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greaterthan the Toughness characteristic of your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll
QI|IN THE SHADOW OF GIANTS|000009762004|Questor Forgepact Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Questor Forgepact|000000988|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit is selected to make an advance/fall-back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">MECHANICUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to start an action.
QI|VENGEANCE OF THE MACHINE CULT|000009762003|Questor Forgepact Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Questor Forgepact|000000988|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS TITANIC unit is destroyed by an enemy unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That enemy unit is marked until the end of the battle:<br><ul><li>While a unit is marked, friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">MECHANICUS</span> units’ attacks that target that unit can re-roll wound rolls.</li></ul>
QI|OMNISSIAH’S GRACE|000009762002|Questor Forgepact Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Questor Forgepact|000000988|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 5+ against mortal wounds.
QI|UNSTOPPABLE WARRIOR|000010503006|Questoris Companions – Epic Deed Stratagem|2|Your turn|Movement phase|Questoris Companions|000001108|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after an Imperial Knights Titanic unit from your army Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">TITANIC</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.
QI|DRIVEN BY THE PAST|000010503007|Questoris Companions – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Questoris Companions|000001108|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights Titanic unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.
QI|COURAGEOUS STAND|000010503002|Questoris Companions – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Questoris Companions|000001108|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights Titanic unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability.
QI|TITANIC DUEL|000010503003|Questoris Companions – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Questoris Companions|000001108|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights Titanic model from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your model makes an attack that targets a <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span>, <span class="kwb">TITANIC</span> or <span class="kwb">WALKER</span> unit, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll.
QI|MOMENT OF GLORY|000010503004|Questoris Companions – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Questoris Companions|000001108|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just before an Imperial Knights Titanic unit from your army Consolidates.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">TITANIC</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your unit Consolidates, models in it can move an additional 3" provided your unit can end that move within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.
QI|HERO’S TREAD|000010503005|Questoris Companions – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Questoris Companions|000001108|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights Titanic model from your army that is within range of an objective marker you control.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your Level of Control over that objective marker is 5 (unless it would otherwise be higher), until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
QI|EXEMPLAR’S WISDOM|000010507003|Spearhead-At-Arms – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Spearhead-At-Arms|000001109|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, just after an Imperial Knights Titanic model from your army has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">TITANIC</span> model, and one or more friendly Armiger models affected by that model’s Bondsman ability.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time one of your <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.
QI|THIN THEIR RANKS|000010507005|Spearhead-At-Arms – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Spearhead-At-Arms|000001109|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Armiger model from your army, or one Imperial Knights Titanic model from your army, and one or more friendly <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models affected by that model’s Bondsman ability.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by your <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models have the [RAPID FIRE 1] ability.
QI|VIRTUE OF COURAGE|000010507002|Spearhead-At-Arms – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Spearhead-At-Arms|000001109|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Armiger model from your army, or one Imperial Knights Titanic model from your army, and one or more friendly <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models affected by that model’s Bondsman ability.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit. Until the end of the phase, each time one of your <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll.
QI|LET DUTY BE YOUR SHIELD|000010507006|Spearhead-At-Arms – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Spearhead-At-Arms|000001109|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Armiger unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking units attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.
QI|MANTLE OF THE MENTOR|000010507004|Spearhead-At-Arms – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Spearhead-At-Arms|000001109|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Armiger model from your army, or one Imperial Knights Titanic model from your army, and one or more friendly <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models affected by that model’s Bondsman ability.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, your <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models are eligible to shoot in a turn in which they Fell Back.
QI|SQUIRES OFTHE HUNT|000010507007|Spearhead-At-Arms – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Spearhead-At-Arms|000001109|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Armiger model from your army, or one Imperial Knights Titanic model from your army, and one or more friendly <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models affected by that model’s Bondsman ability.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> For each of your <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> models that is within 9" of one or more battlefield edges and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, remove that <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> model from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.
QI|HONOURED TO SERVE|000011009004|Throne-Bonded Outriders Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Throne-Bonded Outriders|000001167|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly ARMIGER unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Those attacks do not prevent your unit from being eligible to start an action.
QI|NEURAL LASH|000011009002|Throne-Bonded Outriders Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Throne-Bonded Outriders|000001167|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS TITANIC unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one friendly battle-shocked ARMIGER unit within 12" of your unit. That <span class="kwb">ARMIGER</span> unit is no longer <b>battle-shocked</b>.
QI|HELM CONDITIONING|000011009003|Throne-Bonded Outriders Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Throne-Bonded Outriders|000001167|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase, when a friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit uses a Bondsman ability.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">IMPERIAL</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When selecting an ARMIGER model for that <b>Bondsman</b> ability, you can select one within 18" of your unit (excluding models already affected by a <b>Bondsman</b> ability).
QI|THUNDERSTOMP|000010494003|Valourstrike Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Valourstrike Lance|000001106|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights model from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, the Attacks characteristic of any armoured Feet melee weapons equipped by your model is 8, the Attacks characteristic of any titanic Feet melee weapons equipped by your model is 12, and improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of those weapons by 1.
QI|FULL TILT|000010494004|Valourstrike Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Your turn|Movement phase|Valourstrike Lance|000001106|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, add 2" to the Move characteristic of your models and add 2 to Advance rolls made for those model’s units.
QI|TACTICAL FOIL|000010494006|Valourstrike Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Valourstrike Lance|000001106|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights model from your army that is within 8" of that unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your model can make a Normal move of up to D6".
QI|VOW OF RETRIBUTION|000010494005|Valourstrike Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Valourstrike Lance|000001106|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by your models have the [LETHAL HITS] ability.
QI|RUN THEM THROUGH!|000010494002|Valourstrike Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Valourstrike Lance|000001106|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by your models have the [LANCE] ability.
QI|ROTATE ION SHIELDS|000010494007|Valourstrike Lance – Wargear Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Valourstrike Lance|000001106|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Imperial Knights unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save.
QT|RUNE-CURSED STRONGHOLD|000011013002|Bastions of Tyranny Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Bastions of Tyranny|000001173|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly KNIGHT TYRANT unit suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KNIGHT</span> <span class="kwb">TYRANT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 5+ against mortal wounds.
QT|PITILESS FOCUS|000011013003|Bastions of Tyranny Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Bastions of Tyranny|000001173|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly KNIGHT TYRANT unit is selected to make a fall-back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That KNIGHT TYRANT unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to shoot.
QT|INTIMIDATING REMINDER|000011013004|Bastions of Tyranny Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Bastions of Tyranny|000001173|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly KNIGHT TYRANT unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KNIGHT</span> <span class="kwb">TYRANT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit is <b>suppressed</b> until the start of your next Command phase:<br><ul><li>While a unit is <b>suppressed</b>, that unit’s attacks have -1 to hit rolls.</li></ul>
QT|FLUSH THE QUARRY|000010752005|Helhunt Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Helhunt Lance|000001144|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Titanic Chaos Knights unit from your army and up to three friendly War Dog units within 6" of that Titanic Chaos Knights unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time one of those War Dog units makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, its models can move through models and terrain features. When doing so, they can move within Engagement Range of such models but cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed.
QT|MERCILESS FUSILLADE|000010752003|Helhunt Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Helhunt Lance|000001144|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase or the start of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Titanic Chaos Knights unit from your army, and up to two friendly War Dog units, that have not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit that is an eligible target for each of those <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> units. Until the end of the phase, each time one of those Chaos Knights units is selected to shoot or fight, if that enemy unit is an eligible target, you can only select that enemy unit as the target for all of those attacks and those attacks have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability.
QT|BEASTHIDE MANIFESTATION|000010752004|Helhunt Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Helhunt Lance|000001144|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.
QT|CONTEMPTUOUS VOLLEYS|000010752006|Helhunt Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Helhunt Lance|000001144|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> unit from your army Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That Chaos Knights unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.
QT|FERAL ARROGANCE|000010752002|Helhunt Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Helhunt Lance|000001144|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just after a mortal wound is allocated to a Chaos Knights unit from your army.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability against mortal wounds.
QT|GOADED BEAST|000010752007|Helhunt Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Helhunt Lance|000001144|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One CHAOS KNIGHTS unit from your army that lost one or more wounds as a result of those attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a surge move of up to D6"
QT|HUNGRY FOR COMBAT|000010313003|Houndpack Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Houndpack Lance|000001077|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Two or more War Dog units from your army within Engagement Range of the same enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of those <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> units. Until the end of the phase, models in those <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> units can only target that enemy unit, but each time a model in one of those <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> units makes an attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.
QT|VOX-HOWL|000010313002|Houndpack Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Houndpack Lance|000001077|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of the Shooting phase or the start of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One War Dog Character unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Each enemy unit within 6" of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. Each friendly <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> unit that is within 6" of your unit and is Battle-shocked must take a Leadership test; if that test is passed, that unit is no longer Battle-shocked.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You can only use this Stratagem once per turn.
QT|ANIMALISTIC RAGE|000010313005|Houndpack Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Houndpack Lance|000001077|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after a WAR DOG unit from your army that has not been selected to attack this phase is destroyed.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Before resolving your unit’s Deadly Demise ability, it can either shoot or fight. When doing so, it must target only the enemy unit that just destroyed it, and can only do so if that enemy unit is an eligible target. After it has done so and after any Consolidation moves have been made, resolve your unit’s <b>Deadly Demise</b> ability as normal.
QT|ENCIRCLING PACK|000010313007|Houndpack Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Houndpack Lance|000001077|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One War Dog unit from your army that is wholly within 12" of one or more battlefield edges and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.
QT|HARRYING HOUNDS|000010313006|Houndpack Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Houndpack Lance|000001077|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One War Dog unit from your army that is within 8" of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6".
QT|CUNNING HUNTER|000010313004|Houndpack Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Houndpack Lance|000001077|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a War Dog unit from your army Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.
QT|STALKING FOCUS|000011017004|Hunting Warpack Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Hunting Warpack|000001174|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly WAR DOG unit within range of an objective.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>AP</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
QT|INSENSATE BLOODTHIRST |000011017002|Hunting Warpack Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Hunting Warpack|000001174|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly WAR DOG unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 5+
QT|LEASH OF THE MASTERS|000011017003|Hunting Warpack Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Hunting Warpack|000001174|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly WAR DOG unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Those attacks do not prevent your unit from being eligible to start an action.
QT|AVENGE THE MASTERS!|000009766002|Iconoclast Fiefdom Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Iconoclast Fiefdom|000000989|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly CHAOS KNIGHTS unit is destroyed by an enemy unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That enemy unit is <b>marked</b> until the end of the battle.<br><ul><li>Friendly DAMNED units’ attacks that target a <b>marked</b> unit have [LETHAL HITS].</li></ul>
QT|DARK SACRIFICE|000009766003|Iconoclast Fiefdom Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Iconoclast Fiefdom|000000989|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly DAMNED unit (excluding ACCURSED CULTISTS units) within 9" of a friendly CHAOS KNIGHTS model.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> model within 9" of your unit and roll D3+3:<br><ul><li>Your <span class="kwb">DAMNED</span> unit suffers that number of mortal wounds.</li><li>That <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> model heals that number of wounds.</li></ul>
QT|COURSING THRALLS|000009766004|Iconoclast Fiefdom Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Iconoclast Fiefdom|000000989|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly DAMNED unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one visible enemy unit within 12" of your unit. That enemy unit is <b>hunted</b>:<br><ul><li>While a unit is <b>hunted</b>, that unit has +6" detection range.</li></ul>
QT|HELLFORGED CONSTRUCTION|000010305003|Infernal Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Infernal Lance|000001075|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.
QT|PROFANE SYMBIOSIS|000010305002|Infernal Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Infernal Lance|000001075|<b>WHEN:</b> End of any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that is not Empowered.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit makes a Malefic Surge.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot select the same unit as the target of this Stratagem more than once per battle round.
QT|CORRUPTING TAINT|000010305004|Infernal Lance – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Infernal Lance|000001075|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase, just after a Chaos Knights Character unit from your army makes a Malefic Surge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective marker your unit is within range of that you control. That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
QT|UNLEASH BALEFIRE|000010305005|Infernal Lance – Wargear Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Infernal Lance|000001075|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> After your unit has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. That enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test; if the test is failed, until the end of your opponent’s next turn, it is aflame. While a unit is aflame, subtract 2" from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for it.
QT|WARP VISION|000010305006|Infernal Lance – Wargear Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Infernal Lance|000001075|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability.
QT|DIABOLIC BULWARK|000010305007|Infernal Lance – Wargear Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Infernal Lance|000001075|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save.
QT|CRUSHED LIKE VERMIN|000010309007|Lords of Dread – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Lords of Dread|000001076|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a Chaos Knights Character unit from your army ends a Normal move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit (excluding <span class="kwb">MONSTERS</span> and <span class="kwb">VEHICLES</span>) that your unit moved over during that move and roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. If one or more models are destroyed as a result of this Stratagem, that enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test.
QT|TROPHY HUNTER|000010309006|Lords of Dread – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Lords of Dread|000001076|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just before a Chaos Knights Character unit from your army consolidates.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your unit Consolidates, models in it can move an additional 3" as long as your unit can end that move within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.
QT|TITANIC DUEL|000010309005|Lords of Dread – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Lords of Dread|000001076|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights Character unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> or <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and re-roll a Wound roll of 1. Each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, if that enemy unit is <span class="kwb">TITANIC</span>, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll instead.
QT|RUNES OF DISDAIN|000010309004|Lords of Dread – Epic Deed Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Lords of Dread|000001076|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights Character unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.
QT|SPITEFUL DEMISE|000010309003|Lords of Dread – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Lords of Dread|000001076|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just after a Chaos Knights Character unit from your army is destroyed.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CHAOS</span> <span class="kwb">KNIGHTS</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When rolling to determine whether mortal wounds are inflicted by your unit’s Deadly Demise ability, that model’s Deadly Demise ability inflicts mortal wounds on a D6 roll of a 4+ instead of on a 6.
QT|CLAIMED FOR THE DARK GODS|000010309002|Lords of Dread – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Lords of Dread|000001076|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights Character unit from your army that is within range of one or more objective markers you control.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one of those objective markers. That objective marker remains under your control, with a Level of Control of 5 (unless it would otherwise be higher), until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
QT|CONQUERORS WITHOUT MERCY|000008517003|Traitoris Lance – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Traitoris Lance|000000806|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights model from your army that made a Charge move this turn and has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by your model by 1. After your model has finished making its attacks this phase, if it destroyed one or more enemy units this phase, each enemy unit within 6" of your model must take a Battle-shock test.
QT|IMPERIOUS ADVANCE|000008517006|Traitoris Lance – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Traitoris Lance|000000806|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two War Dog units from your army or one Titanic Chaos Knights unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in one of your units makes a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move, it can move through models and terrain features. When doing so, it can move within Engagement Range of such models but, unless it made a Charge move, cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed (the Super-heavy Walker ability does not apply while using this Stratagem).
QT|A LONG LEASH|000008517005|Traitoris Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Traitoris Lance|000000806|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Abhorrent unit from your army and up to two friendly War Dog units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, those <span class="kwb">WAR</span> <span class="kwb">DOG</span> units are treated as being within range of any Aura abilities your <span class="kwb">ABHORRENT</span> unit has.
QT|DISDAIN FOR THE WEAK|000008517004|Traitoris Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Traitoris Lance|000000806|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability, and the Feel No Pain 5+ ability against attacks made by Battle-shocked models.
QT|STORM OF DARKNESS|000008517007|Traitoris Lance – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Traitoris Lance|000000806|<b>WHEN</b>: Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT</b>:<br><ul><li>Your unit has Stealth.</li><li>Melee attacks that target your unit have -1 to hit rolls.</li></ul>
QT|PTERRORSHADES|000008517002|Traitoris Lance – Wargear Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Traitoris Lance|000000806|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just after an enemy unit fails a Battle-shock test.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Chaos Knights unit from your army that is within 12" of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound and one model in your unit regains up to 1 lost wound.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You can only use this Stratagem once per battle round.
SM|IN THE SHADOW OF GREAT WINGS|000009836007|Angelic Inheritors Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Angelic Inheritors|000001004|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Adeptus Astartes Character unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has:<br><ul><li>Stealth.</li><li>-3" detection range.</li></ul>
SM|INSTANT OF GRACE|000009836004|Angelic Inheritors Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Angelic Inheritors|000001004|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|STRIKE NOW FOR GLORY|000009836003|Angelic Inheritors Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Angelic Inheritors|000001004|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase when a friendly Adeptus Astartes unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1].
SM|UNTO THE BURNING SKIES|000009836006|Angelic Inheritors Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Angelic Inheritors|000001004|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly The Sanguinor/unengaged Adeptus Astartes Jump Pack unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
SM|MEASURED STRATEGIST|000009836005|Angelic Inheritors Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Angelic Inheritors|000001004|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Adeptus Astartes Character unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one combat doctrine. That <b>combat doctrine</b> is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|FOCUSED FURY|000009836002|Angelic Inheritors Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Angelic Inheritors|000001004|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks:<br><ul><li>Have [LETHAL HITS].</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit is a Character unit, have [LETHAL HITS], [LANCE].</li></ul>
SM|ARMOUR OF CONTEMPT|000011205002|Assault Brethren Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Assault Brethren|000001238|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>AP</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|DUTY IN DEATH|000011205004|Assault Brethren Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Assault Brethren|000001238|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When a model in your unit is destroyed, if your unit has not been selected to fight this phase, roll one D6, with +1 to that roll if the assault doctrine is active for your unit:<br><ul><li>On a 4+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield.</li></ul>
SM|GENE-WROUGHT MIGHT|000011205003|Assault Brethren Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Assault Brethren|000001238|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have:<br><ul><li>[Lance].</li><li><u>Or:</u> If the assault doctrine is active for your unit, [Lance] and +1 <b>AP</b>.</li></ul>
SM|KRAKEN ROUNDS|000008523003|Black Spear Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Black Spear Task Force|000000808|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KILL</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks:<br><ul><li>Have +6" <b>R</b>.</li><li>Have +1 <b>S</b>.</li></ul>
SM|HELLFIRE ROUNDS|000008523004|Black Spear Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Black Spear Task Force|000000808|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KILL</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks (excluding [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] attacks) have [ANTI-non-VEHICLE 4+].
SM|ARMOUR OF CONTEMPT|000008523002|Black Spear Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Black Spear Task Force|000000808|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>AP</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|SITE-TO-SITE TELEPORTATION|000008523007|Black Spear Task Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Black Spear Task Force|000000808|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>Place your unit in strategic reserves.</li><li>If your unit has Kill Team, your unit has Deep Strike until the end of your next Movement phase.</li></ul>
SM|ADAPTIVE TACTICS|000008523006|Black Spear Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Black Spear Task Force|000000808|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one combat doctrine. That <b>combat doctrine</b> is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|DRAGONFIRE ROUNDS|000008523005|Black Spear Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Black Spear Task Force|000000808|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KILL</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks:<br><ul><li>Can re-roll wound rolls of 1.</li><li>Have [IGNORES COVER].</li></ul>
SM|ARMOUR OF CONTEMPT|000010634002|Blade of Ultramar Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Blade of Ultramar|000001120|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>AP</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|EXEMPLARY VIGILANCE|000010634003|Blade of Ultramar Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Blade of Ultramar|000001120|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have [IGNORES COVER].
SM|COURAGE AND HONOUR!|000010634005|Blade of Ultramar Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Blade of Ultramar|000001120|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have [Lance].
SM|PRACTICAL TACTICS|000010634006|Blade of Ultramar Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Blade of Ultramar|000001120|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8" of a friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3".
SM|TACTICAL FORESIGHT|000010634007|Blade of Ultramar Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Blade of Ultramar|000001120|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit with a <b>S</b> greater than this unit’s <b>T</b> have -1 to wound rolls.
SM|ULTRAMARIAN ADAPTIVITY|000010634004|Blade of Ultramar Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Blade of Ultramar|000001120|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one combat doctrine. That <b>combat doctrine</b> is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|IN THE EMPEROR’S NAME|000009241002|Boarding Strike – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Boarding Strike|000000905|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Adeptus Astartes Battleline unit from your army that is within range of an objective marker and was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability.
SM|CERAMITE BULWARK|000009241003|Boarding Strike – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Boarding Strike|000000905|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Adeptus Astartes Battleline unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select any number of models in your unit. Until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Attacks and Strength characteristics of melee weapons equipped by the selected models and each time you select targets for attacks made by those models, they must target an enemy unit that is wholly on the opposite side of a Hatchway from them.
SM|VOX-AMPLIFIED ROAR|000009241005|Boarding Strike – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Boarding Strike|000000905|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase, just after an <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army declares a charge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Each target of that charge must take a Battle-shock test.
SM|DUTY AND DEFIANCE|000009241004|Boarding Strike – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Boarding Strike|000000905|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if your unit has the Battleline keyword: on a 4+, do not remove the destroyed model from play; it can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.
SM|EVASIVE REPOSITIONING|000010760007|Ceramite Sentinels Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Ceramite Sentinels|000001146|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit that lost a wound as a result of those attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>Your unit can make a normal move of up to D6".</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit is entrenched, your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3".</li></ul>Your unit is <u>not</u> able to embark within a <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> until the end of the turn.
SM|ESTABLISH SUPREMACY|000010760005|Ceramite Sentinels Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Ceramite Sentinels|000001146|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly entrenched ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit is selected to make a consolidation move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> You can select the objective consolidation mode for that <b>consolidation move</b>, regardless of that <b>consolidation move</b>’s Before Moving restrictions.<br><br><b>Designer’s Note:</b> <i>This means your unit can move out of engagement range with enemy units, provided it meets the conditions of the objective consolidation mode.</i>
SM|PRIORITY STRIKE|000010760006|Ceramite Sentinels Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Ceramite Sentinels|000001146|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks that target a <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span>/<span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit, have +1 to wound rolls.
SM|AUGMENTED TARGETING|000010760004|Ceramite Sentinels Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Ceramite Sentinels|000001146|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have:<br><ul><li>[LETHAL HITS].</li><li><u>Or:</u> [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit is entrenched, [LETHAL HITS] and [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</li></ul>
SM|STAND TO THE END|000010760003|Ceramite Sentinels Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Ceramite Sentinels|000001146|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit (excluding <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span>/<span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> units).<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>Attacks that target your unit with a <b>S</b> greater than your unit’s <b>T</b> have -1 to wound rolls.</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit is entrenched, attacks that target your unit have -1 to wound rolls.</li></ul>
SM|UNYIELDING MIGHT|000010760002|Ceramite Sentinels Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Ceramite Sentinels|000001146|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit that is within range of an objective.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has +1 <b>OC</b> until the end of the turn.
SM|BIRTH OF A SAGA|000009852004|Champions of Fenris Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Champions of Fenris|000001008|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit (excluding Monster/Vehicle units).<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, your unit has <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span>.
SM|HEROIC RESOLVE|000009852003|Champions of Fenris Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Champions of Fenris|000001008|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Adeptus Astartes Character unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>D</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|CHAMPION'S GUIDANCE|000009852002|Champions of Fenris Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Champions of Fenris|000001008|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Character unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks can re-roll hit rolls of 1 and wound rolls of 1.
SM|WINGS OF SHADOW|000011096004|Darkflight Pursuit Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Darkflight Pursuit|000001205|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Ravenwing Fly/Mounted unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">RAVENWING</span> <span class="kwb">FLY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Stealth.
SM|SKYBORNE SURVEILLANCE|000011096002|Darkflight Pursuit Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Darkflight Pursuit|000001205|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Ravenwing Fly unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">RAVENWING</span> <span class="kwb">FLY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Visible enemy units within 6" of your unit have +3" detection range.
SM|WE ARE VENGEANCE|000011096003|Darkflight Pursuit Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Darkflight Pursuit|000001205|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged Ravenwing Fly unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">RAVENWING</span> <span class="kwb">FLY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3".
SM|HELLFIRE ROUNDS|000011169004|Deathwatch Support Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Deathwatch Support|000001229|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KILL</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks (excluding [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] attacks) have [ANTI-non-VEHICLE 4+].
SM|KRAKEN ROUNDS|000011169002|Deathwatch Support Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Deathwatch Support|000001229|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KILL</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have:<br><ul><li>Have +6" <b>R</b>.</li><li>Have +1 <b>S</b>.</li></ul>
SM|DRAGONFIRE ROUNDS|000011169003|Deathwatch Support Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Deathwatch Support|000001229|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KILL</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks:<br><ul><li>Can re-roll wound rolls of 1.</li><li>Have [IGNORES COVER].</li></ul>
SM|BLACKSTAR EXTRACTION|000011169005|Deathwatch Support Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Deathwatch Support|000001229|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged KILL TEAM unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
SM|ARMOUR OF CONTEMPT|000011213002|Devastator Brethren Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Devastator Brethren|000001240|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>AP</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|HAIL OF VENGEANCE|000011213004|Devastator Brethren Stratagem|2|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Devastator Brethren|000001240|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot, if those attacks destroyed a model in a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit shoots using normal shooting, but while doing so your unit can only target that enemy unit.
SM|STORM OF FIRE|000011213003|Devastator Brethren Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Devastator Brethren|000001240|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have:<br><ul><li>[Ignores Cover].</li><li><u>Or:</u> If the devastator doctrine is active for your unit, [Ignores Cover] and +1 <b>AP</b>.</li></ul>
SM|INEXORABLE VALOUR|000011084003|Encarmine Speartip Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Encarmine Speartip|000001214|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit that was engaged with a friendly Sanguinary Guard unit ends a fall-back move, if that <span class="kwb">SANGUINARY</span> <span class="kwb">GUARD</span> unit is unengaged.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SANGUINARY</span> <span class="kwb">GUARD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3".
SM|JUDGEMENT OF THE GOLDEN HOST|000011084002|Encarmine Speartip Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Encarmine Speartip|000001214|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase, when a friendly Sanguinary Guard unit form your army ends a charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SANGUINARY</span> <span class="kwb">GUARD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit engaged with your unit. Roll one D6 for each model in your unit <b>engaged</b> with that enemy unit:<br><ul><li>For each 3+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</li></ul>
SM|BLINDING BLURS OF VENGEANCE|000011084004|Encarmine Speartip Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Encarmine Speartip|000001214|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Sanguinary Guard unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SANGUINARY</span> <span class="kwb">GUARD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has:<br><ul><li>Stealth.</li><li>-3" detection range.</li></ul>
SM|DOCTRINAL FLEXIBILITY|000011177002|Fist of the God-Emperor Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Fist of the God-Emperor|000001231|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Crusader Squad unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one combat doctrine. That <b>combat doctrine</b> is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|AVOWED DESTRUCTION|000011177004|Fist of the God-Emperor Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Fist of the God-Emperor|000001231|<b>WHEN:</b> The Fight phase, when a friendly CRUSADER SQUAD unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CRUSADER</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks:<br><ul><li>Have [LETHAL HITS].</li><li><u>Or:</u> Have [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</li></ul>
SM|ANGELS DEFIANT|000011177003|Fist of the God-Emperor Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Fist of the God-Emperor|000001231|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly CRUSADER SQUAD unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CRUSADER</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit with a <b>S</b> greater than your unit’s <b>T</b> have -1 to wound rolls.
SM|WRATH AND RUIN|000010369003|Forgefather's Seekers Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Forgefather’s Seekers|000001086|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> The assault doctrine <u>or</u> tactical doctrine is active for your unit, until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|BLAZING EARTH|000010369002|Forgefather's Seekers Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Forgefather’s Seekers|000001086|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your opponent’s Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit equipped with one or more Torrent/Melta weapons.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one visible enemy unit within 12" of your unit. That enemy unit has -1 to charge rolls.
SM|IMMOLATION PROTOCOLS|000010369005|Forgefather's Seekers Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Forgefather’s Seekers|000001086|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes infantry unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged [TORRENT] attacks have +1 <b>AP</b>.
SM|BURNING VENGEANCE|000010369007|Forgefather's Seekers Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Forgefather’s Seekers|000001086|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot a friendly Adeptus Astartes Transport unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit embarked within that <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit can:<br><ul><li>Make a disembark move.</li><li>Shoot using normal shooting, but when doing so your unit can only target that enemy unit.</li></ul>
SM|CRUCIBLE OF BATTLE|000010369006|Forgefather's Seekers Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Forgefather’s Seekers|000001086|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes infantry unit is selected to attack an enemy unit within 6".<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks can:<br><ul><li>Re-roll hit rolls of 1.</li><li>Re-roll wound rolls of 1.</li></ul>
SM|FORGED IN FIRE|000010369004|Forgefather's Seekers Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Forgefather’s Seekers|000001086|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly engaged <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s Torrent weapons:<br><ul><li>Do not have [Blast].</li><li>Have [Close-Quarters].</li><li>Have +1 <b>A</b>.</li></ul>
SM|DUTY IS NEVER DONE|000011185003|Gauntlet Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Gauntlet Task Force|000001233|<b>WHEN:</b> End of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit that was eligible to fight this phase, is wholly within 6" of a friendly Transport unit, and is eligible to embark within that <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit embarks within that <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> unit.
SM|STORM AND SECURE|000011185004|Gauntlet Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Gauntlet Task Force|000001233|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Adeptus Astartes Transport unit that has an Adeptus Astartes Battleline unit embarked within it.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective your unit is controlling. That <b>objective</b> is secured.
SM|AGGRESSIVE DISEMBARKATION|000011185002|Gauntlet Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Gauntlet Task Force|000001233|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit embarked within a Transport is selected to move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> While making that move, each model in your unit can be set up within the <b>set-up distance</b> of that <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span>.<br><br><i>This allows you to set up your unit <u>within</u> the <b>set-up distance</b> of your <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span>, instead of <u>wholly within</u> that distance.</i>
SM|STORM OF DEVASTATION|000008352006|Gladius Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Gladius Task Force|000000750|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have [IGNORES COVER].
SM|RESPONSIVE TACTICS|000008352007|Gladius Task Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Gladius Task Force|000000750|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8" of a friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of up to D6".
SM|A WORTHY DEATH|000008352003|Gladius Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Gladius Task Force|000000750|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When a model in your unit is destroyed, if your unit has not been selected to fight this phase, roll one D6:<br><ul><li>On a 4+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield.</li></ul>
SM|ARMOUR OF CONTEMPT|000008352002|Gladius Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Gladius Task Force|000000750|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>AP</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|MIGHT OF ANGELS|000008352004|Gladius Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Gladius Task Force|000000750|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have [Lance].
SM|ADAPTIVE STRATEGY|000008352005|Gladius Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Gladius Task Force|000000750|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one combat doctrine. That <b>combat doctrine</b> is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|ARMOURED IMPACT|000011209004|Gravis Linebreaker Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Gravis Linebreaker Force|000001239|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase, when a friendly Gravis unit ends a charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">GRAVIS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When your unit ends a <b>charge move</b>, you can select one enemy unit engaged with your unit. If you do, roll one D6 for each model in your unit <b>engaged</b> with that enemy unit:<br><ul><li>For each 3+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</li></ul>
SM|ANNIHILATING FORCE|000011209002|Gravis Linebreaker Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Gravis Linebreaker Force|000001239|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly Gravis unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">GRAVIS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have [Lethal Hits].
SM|PURGATION PUSH|000011209003|Gravis Linebreaker Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Gravis Linebreaker Force|000001239|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Gravis unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">GRAVIS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>If your unit is unengaged, your unit can make a normal move of up to 5", and must end that move within range of an objective.</li><li>Your unit is <u>not</u> eligible to declare a charge or embark within a Transport until the end of the turn.</li></ul>
SM|SUPPRESSION VOLLEYS|000011217004|Gravis Siege Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Gravis Siege Force|000001241|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Gravis unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">GRAVIS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit makes a battle-shock roll, with -1 to that <b>battle-shock roll</b>.
SM|STAND UNYIELDING|000011217003|Gravis Siege Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Gravis Siege Force|000001241|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Gravis unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective your unit is controlling. That <b>objective</b> is secured.
SM|ANNIHILATING FORCE|000011217002|Gravis Siege Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Gravis Siege Force|000001241|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly Gravis unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">GRAVIS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have [Lethal Hits].
SM|WRATH OF THE LION|000008775004|Inner Circle Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Inner Circle Task Force|000000835|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase, when a friendly Deathwing unit ends a charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DEATHWING</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit engaged with your unit. If you do, roll one D6 for each model in your unit <b>engaged</b> with that enemy unit:<br><ul><li>For each 3+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 <b>mortal wounds</b>).</li></ul>
SM|DUTY UNTO DEATH|000008775002|Inner Circle Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Inner Circle Task Force|000000835|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Deathwing unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DEATHWING</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When a model in your unit is destroyed, if your unit has not been selected to fight this phase, roll one D6, with +1 to that roll if your unit is engaged with an enemy unit within range of your vowed objective:<br><ul><li>On a 4+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield.</li></ul>
SM|RELIC TELEPORTARIUM|000008775003|Inner Circle Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Inner Circle Task Force|000000835|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly Deathwing unit with the Deep Strike ability is selected to make an ingress move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DEATHWING</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>Your unit can be set up more than 6" horizontally from all enemy units (instead of more than 8").</li><li>Your unit is <u>not</u> eligible to declare a charge until the end of this turn.</li></ul>
SM|ADAMANTINE TERROR|000011225002|Ironclad Champions Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Ironclad Champions|000001243|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Dreadnought unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Each enemy unit engaged with your unit makes a battle-shock roll, with -1 to that <b>battle-shock roll</b>.
SM|UPSTOPPABLE ADVANCE|000011225004|Ironclad Champions Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Ironclad Champions|000001243|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement/Charge phase, when a friendly Dreadnought unit is selected to move or declares a charge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DREADNOUGHT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Mobile.
SM|MERCY IS WEAKNESS|000011225003|Ironclad Champions Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Ironclad Champions|000001243|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly Dreadnought unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DREADNOUGHT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have:<br><ul><li>[lethal hits].</li><li><u>Or:</u> [Sustained Hits 1].</li></ul>
SM|MIGHT OF THE MACHINE SPIRIT|000008479003|Ironstorm Spearhead Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Ironstorm Spearhead|000000794|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Adeptus Astartes Vehicle unit (excluding Dedicated Transport/Fly/Walker units).<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit’s:<br><ul><li><b>M</b>.</li><li><b>BS</b>.</li><li>Hit rolls and wound rolls.</li></ul>
SM|LAYERED CERAMITE|000008479002|Ironstorm Spearhead Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Ironstorm Spearhead|000000794|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Vehicle unit suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 5+ against <b>mortal wounds</b>.
SM|HEADHUNTER DOCTRINE|000008479004|Ironstorm Spearhead Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Ironstorm Spearhead|000000794|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Vehicle unit (excluding Dedicated Transport/Fly/Walker units) is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have [Lethal Hits: Monster/Vehicle].
SM|SLAYERS OF ABOMINATIONS|000011076002|Marshal's Household Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Marshal’s Household|000001209|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Sword Brethren Squad unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SWORD</span> <span class="kwb">BRETHREN</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks that target a <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span>/<span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit have +2 <b>S</b>.
SM|UNSPARING EXECUTION|000011076003|Marshal's Household Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Marshal’s Household|000001209|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when a unit is selected to make a fall-back move, if that unit is engaged with a friendly Sword Brethren Squad  unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SWORD</span> <span class="kwb">BRETHREN</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When an enemy unit <b>engaged</b> with your unit is selected to make a <b>fall-back move</b> , that enemy unit must use the desperate escape mode, with -1 to those hazard rolls if that enemy unit is battle-shocked.
SM|BLADE OF DETESTATION|000011076004|Marshal's Household Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Marshal’s Household|000001209|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase, when a friendly Sword Brethren Squad unit ends a charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SWORD</span> <span class="kwb">BRETHREN</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span>.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit engaged with your unit. Roll one D6 for each model in your unit <b>engaged</b> with that enemy unit:<br><ul><li>For each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 <b>mortal wounds</b>).</li></ul>
SM|VENGEFUL ANIMUS|000011181004|Medusa's Wrath Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Medusa's Wrath|000001232|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE unit is destroyed, before rolling for deadly demise.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Change any <b>deadly demise rolls</b> made for this unit to an unmodified 6.
SM|SPIRITS OF IRON|000011181003|Medusa's Wrath Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Medusa's Wrath|000001232|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel no pain 5+ against <b>mortal wounds</b>.
SM|ANCIENT FURY|000011181005|Medusa's Wrath Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Medusa's Wrath|000001232|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES DREADNOUGHT unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, your unit has:<br><ul><li>+1" <b>M</b>.</li><li>+1 <b>T</b>.</li><li>+1 <b>Ld</b>.</li><li>+1 <b>OC</b>.</li><li>+1 to hit rolls.</li></ul>
SM|UNBOWED CONVICTION|000011181006|Medusa's Wrath Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Medusa's Wrath|000001232|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit that is below starting strength.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit’s:<br><ul><li><b>BS</b> and <b>WS</b>.</li><li>Hit rolls and Wound rolls.</li></ul>
SM|POWER OF THE MACHINE SPIRIT|000011181007|Medusa's Wrath Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Medusa's Wrath|000001232|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Vehicle unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit shoots using:<br><ul><li>Snap shooting.</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit is at half-strength/below half-strength, normal shooting.</li></ul>While doing so your unit can only target that enemy unit.
SM|METHODICAL BRUTALITY|000011181002|Medusa's Wrath Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Medusa's Wrath|000001232|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1].<br><br><b>SECONDARY EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>If your unit is a <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit, have +1 to wound rolls.</li></ul>
SM|TACTICAL WITHDRAWAL|000011189004|Phobos Shadow Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Phobos Shadow Force|000001234|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged Phobos/Scout SQUAD unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
SM|MORTIS SNARES|000011189003|Phobos Shadow Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Phobos Shadow Force|000001234|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged Phobos/Scout Squad unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> If your unit is controlling an objective, that <b>objective</b> is <b>snared</b>. While an <b>objective</b> is <b>snared</b>, when an enemy unit ends a move within range of that <b>objective</b>, roll one D6:<br><ul><li>On a 2+, that enemy unit suffers D6 mortal wounds. </li><li>That <b>objective</b> is no longer <b>snared</b>.</li></ul>
SM|STRIKE FROM THE SHADOWS|000011189002|Phobos Shadow Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Phobos Shadow Force|000001234|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly hidden Phobos unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">PHOBOS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have:<br><ul><li>+1 <b>S</b>.</li><li>[Lethal Hits].</li></ul>
SM|STRIKE FROM THE SHADOWS|000011197002|Phobos Shock Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Phobos Shock Force|000001236|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly hidden Phobos unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">PHOBOS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have:<br><ul><li>+1 <b>S</b>.</li><li>[Lethal Hits].</li></ul>
SM|TRANSHUMAN REACTIONS|000011197003|Phobos Shock Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Phobos Shock Force|000001236|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8" of a friendly unengaged Phobos unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">PHOBOS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of:<br><ul><li>Up to D6".</li><li><u>Or:</u> If the tactical doctrine is active for your unit, up to 6".</li></ul>
SM|UMBRAL EVASION|000011197004|Phobos Shock Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Phobos Shock Force|000001236|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Phobos unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">PHOBOS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 to hit rolls.
SM|MASTER MARKSMEN|000009249005|Pilum Strike Team – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Pilum Strike Team|000000906|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] ability.
SM|KNIFE WORK|000009249002|Pilum Strike Team – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Pilum Strike Team|000000906|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, improve the Strength and Armour Penetration characteristics of melee weapons equipped by models in your unit by 1.
SM|ENHANCED EFFICIENCY|000009249003|Pilum Strike Team – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Pilum Strike Team|000000906|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your unit is selected to make a Normal or Advance move, it can attempt to operate one Hatchway it is within 1” of either at the start or end of that move. If it does, it cannot attempt to operate a Hatchway again this turn.
SM|FIGHTING RETREAT|000009249004|Pilum Strike Team – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Pilum Strike Team|000000906|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after an <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army is selected to Fall Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of your unit and roll one D6: on a 2-4, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound; on a 5+, that enemy unit suffers 2 mortal wounds.
SM|UNBRIDLED FEROICITY|000010270002|Saga of the Beastslayer Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Saga of the Beastslayer|000001070|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Blood Claws/Thunderwolf Cavalry/Wulfen unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">BLOOD</span> <span class="kwb">CLAWS</span>/<span class="kwb">THUNDERWOLF</span> <span class="kwb">CAVALRY</span>/<span class="kwb">WULFEN</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have [LANCE].
SM|CO-ORDINATED STRIKE|000010270003|Saga of the Beastslayer Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Saga of the Beastslayer|000001070|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One unengaged Blood Claws/Thunderwolf Cavalry/Wulfen unit that is within 9" of one or more battlefield edges.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
SM|IMPETUOSITY|000010270004|Saga of the Beastslayer Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Saga of the Beastslayer|000001070|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged Blood Claws/Thunderwolf Cavalry/Wulfen unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">BLOOD</span> <span class="kwb">CLAWS</span>/<span class="kwb">THUNDERWOLF</span> <span class="kwb">CAVALRY</span>/<span class="kwb">WULFEN</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a surge move of up to D6".
SM|BATTLE INSTINCTS|000010661007|Saga of the Great Wolf Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Saga of the Great Wolf|000001126|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3".
SM|GRIMNAR'S COMMAND|000010661006|Saga of the Great Wolf Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Saga of the Great Wolf|000001126|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit (excluding Monster/Vehicle units).<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one combat doctrine. That <b>combat doctrine</b> is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|FENRISIAN FEROCITY|000010661005|Saga of the Great Wolf Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Saga of the Great Wolf|000001126|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement/Charge phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Mounted/Walker unit is selected to move or declares a charge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span>/<span class="kwb">WALKER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Mobile.
SM|FANGS OF THE PACK|000010661004|Saga of the Great Wolf Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Saga of the Great Wolf|000001126|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have [Precision].
SM|WOLF TOTEMS|000010661003|Saga of the Great Wolf Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Saga of the Great Wolf|000001126|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 5+ against <b>mortal wounds</b>.
SM|EYE OF THE PACK|000010661002|Saga of the Great Wolf Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Saga of the Great Wolf|000001126|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, or the Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks can re-roll wound rolls of 1 and 2.
SM|LAY LOW THE TYRANTS|000010467007|Shadowmark Talon Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Shadowmark Talon|000001104|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have [Precision].
SM|FEINT AND THRUST|000010467006|Shadowmark Talon Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Shadowmark Talon|000001104|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> The tactical doctrine is active for your unit in addition to any other combat doctrine, until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|SUPPRESSED WEAPONS|000010467005|Shadowmark Talon Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Shadowmark Talon|000001104|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Those attacks do not prevent your unit from being hidden.
SM|MURDEROUS FUSILLADE|000010467004|Shadowmark Talon Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Shadowmark Talon|000001104|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit that made an ingress move this turn is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have:<br><ul><li>+1 <b>BS</b>.</li><li>+1 <b>AP</b>.</li></ul>
SM|RAPTORIAL VIGILANCE|000010467003|Shadowmark Talon Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Shadowmark Talon|000001104|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8" of a friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of:<br><ul><li>Up to D6".</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit is a Phobos/Scout Squad unit, up to 6".</li></ul>
SM|INTO DARKNESS|000010467002|Shadowmark Talon Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Shadowmark Talon|000001104|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
SM|ADAPTIVE PURGE|000010728004|Shield of the Void – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Shield of the Void|000001139|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one of the following abilities: [LETHAL HITS], [IGNORES COVER] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1]. Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have that ability.
SM|RAPID TAKEOVER|000010728005|Shield of the Void – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Shield of the Void|000001139|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that was within Engagement Range of that enemy unit at the start of the phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D3+1".
SM|OVERCHARGED BREACH|000010728003|Shield of the Void – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Shield of the Void|000001139|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one closed Hatchway within 9" of and visible to your unit. Open that Hatchway and, until the end of the battle, that Hatchway cannot be closed.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot use this Stratagem more than once.
SM|CODEX WARFARE|000010728002|Shield of the Void – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Shield of the Void|000001139|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back.
SM|FLAWLESS RIDERS|000010630004|Spearpoint Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Spearpoint Task Force|000001119|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement/Charge phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes mounted unit is selected to move or declares a charge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Mobile.
SM|SPEAR THRUST AND SABRE SWING|000010630005|Spearpoint Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Spearpoint Task Force|000001119|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks:<br><ul><li>Have [LETHAL HITS].</li><li><u>Or:</u> Have [LANCE].</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit has Mounted, have [LETHAL HITS] and [LANCE].</li></ul>
SM|WITHDRAW AND REGROUP|000010630006|Spearpoint Task Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Spearpoint Task Force|000001119|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Mounted/Speeder unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
SM|HUNTER'S INSTINCTS|000010630007|Spearpoint Task Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Spearpoint Task Force|000001119|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8" of a friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted/Speeder unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span>/<span class="kwb">SPEEDER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3".
SM|MOBILE LETHALITY|000010630003|Spearpoint Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Spearpoint Task Force|000001119|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to make an advance/fall-back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>That <b>fall-back move</b> does not prevent your unit from being eligible to shoot.</li><li>Your unit’s ranged attacks have [ASSAULT].</li></ul>
SM|EVASIVE MANOEUVERS|000010630002|Spearpoint Task Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Spearpoint Task Force|000001119|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Adeptus Astartes Mounted/Speeder unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span>/<span class="kwb">SPEEDER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 to wound rolls.
SM|WIND-SWIFT EVASION|000008487002|Stormlance Task Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Stormlance Task Force|000000796|<b>WHEN:</b> End of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Adeptus Astartes Mounted unit that was eligible to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>If your unit is unengaged, your unit can make a normal move.</li><li><u>Or:</u> If your unit is engaged, your unit can make a fall-back move.</li></ul>
SM|SUDDEN ONSLAUGHT|000008487003|Stormlance Task Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Stormlance Task Force|000000796|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Mounted/Speeder unit is selected to make an advance move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span>/<span class="kwb">SPEEDER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can change its advance rolls to a 6.
SM|HURTLING TARGETS|000008487004|Stormlance Task Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Stormlance Task Force|000000796|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly Adeptus Astartes Mounted/Speeder unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span>/<span class="kwb">SPEEDER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 to hit rolls.
SM|ARMOUR OF CONTEMPT|000011221002|Tactical Brethren Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Tactical Brethren|000001242|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>AP</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|DOMINATION FIRE|000011221003|Tactical Brethren Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Tactical Brethren|000001242|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit is <b>suppressed</b> until the start of your next turn:<br><ul><li>While a unit is <b>suppressed</b>, that unit’s attacks have -1 to hit rolls.</li></ul>
SM|MASTERFUL TACTICS|000011221004|Tactical Brethren Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Tactical Brethren|000001242|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8" of a friendly unengaged Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a normal move of:<br><ul><li>Up to D6".</li><li><u>Or:</u> If the tactical doctrine is active for your unit, up to 6".</li></ul>
SM|TACTICAL FOCUS|000011193004|Tacticus Attack Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Tacticus Attack Force|000001235|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Tacticus unit is selected to make a consolidation move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TACTICUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When making that <b>consolidation move</b>, your unit can move up to D3+3".
SM|RELENTLESS ASSAULT|000011193002|Tacticus Attack Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Tacticus Attack Force|000001235|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly Tacticus unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TACTICUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have:<br><ul><li>[Sustained Hits 1: non-Monster/Vehicle].</li><li><u>Or:</u> [Lethal Hits: Monster/Vehicle].</li></ul>
SM|TRANSHUMAN SWIFTNESS|000011193003|Tacticus Attack Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Tacticus Attack Force|000001235|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when an enemy unit has fought.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Tacticus unit that is within range of an objective and is eligible to fight.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Fights First and <u>must</u> be the next unit you select to fight.
SM|POINT-BLANK BRUTALITY|000011229004|Tacticus Firestorm Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Tacticus Firestorm Force|000001244|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly engaged Tacticus unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TACTICUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks (excluding [Blast] attacks) have:<br><ul><li>[Close-Quarters].</li><li>[Ignores Cover].</li></ul>
SM|FOR THE EMPEROR!|000011229002|Tacticus Firestorm Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Tacticus Firestorm Force|000001244|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Tacticus unit that is within range of an objective.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has +1 <b>OC</b> until the end of the turn.
SM|RELENTLESS ASSAULT|000011229003|Tacticus Firestorm Force Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Tacticus Firestorm Force|000001244|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly Tacticus unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TACTICUS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have:<br><ul><li>[Sustained Hits 1: non-Monster/Vehicle].</li><li><u>Or:</u> [Lethal Hits: Monster/Vehicle].</li></ul>
SM|CLEANSING SWEEP|000009256005|Terminator Assault – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement or Charge phase|Terminator Assault|000000907|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent's Movement or Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Terminator Squad unit from your army that has not fired Overwatch this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack while firing Overwatch, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ is required to score a hit, instead of an unmodified 6.
SM|TOWER OF STRENGTH|000009256002|Terminator Assault – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Terminator Assault|000000907|<b>WHEN:</b> Start or end of any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Adeptus Astartes Terminator unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of your next Command phase, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in your unit.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> Each time you use this Stratagem, you cannot use it again until after your next Command phase.
SM|FOCUSING SHRINE|000009256003|Terminator Assault – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Terminator Assault|000000907|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, at the start of the Reinforcements step.  <br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Adeptus Astartes Terminator unit from your army that is in Reserves.  <br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, when setting up your unit on the battlefield using its Deep Strike ability, you can set it up unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy models (measure this distance as you would normally for the Deep Strike ability, ignoring Walls and closed Hatchways).  <br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is not eligible to declare a charge.
SM|CARVE A PATH|000009256004|Terminator Assault – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Terminator Assault|000000907|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Terminator Assault Squad unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase and has not declared a charge this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, when making a Normal, Advance or Charge move, your unit can move through a single closed Hatchway as if it was open. When doing so, that Hatchway is opened and cannot be closed for the rest of the battle. This can allow that unit to declare a charge against enemy units that are not visible to it, but to do so those enemy units must be within 1" of that Hatchway and wholly on the opposite side of it from your unit.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot use this Stratagem more than once per turn.
SM|TACTICAL DREADNOUGHT FORTITUDE|000011201002|Terminator Storm Force Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Terminator Storm Force|000001237|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly adeptus astartes Terminator unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">TERMINATOR</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>D</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
SM|MERCILESS VETERANS|000011201003|Terminator Storm Force Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Terminator Storm Force|000001237|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly adeptus astartes Terminator unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">TERMINATOR</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have:<br><ul><li>[Lethal Hits].</li><li>[Sustained Hits 1].</li></ul>
SM|GUNSHIP EXTRACTION|000011201004|Terminator Storm Force Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Terminator Storm Force|000001237|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged adeptus astartes terminator unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
SM|FOR THE EMPEROR'S HONOUR!|000011173003|Vow-sworn Crusaders Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Vow-sworn Crusaders|000001230|<b>WHEN:</b> The Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have [PRECISION].
SM|PIOUS ENMITY|000011173006|Vow-sworn Crusaders Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Vow-sworn Crusaders|000001230|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Chaplain/Judiciar unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">CHAPLIN</span>/<span class="kwb">JUDICIAR</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>Your unit’s melee attacks can re-roll hit rolls of 1.</li><li><u>Or:</u> Your unit’s melee attacks that target a <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span>/<span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit can re-roll <b>hit rolls</b> of 1 and wound rolls of 1.</li></ul>
SM|DEVOUT PUSH|000011173007|Vow-sworn Crusaders Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Vow-sworn Crusaders|000001230|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit is selected to make a pile-in/consolidation move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When making that <b>pile-in</b>/<b>consolidation move</b>, your unit can move up to D3+3".
SM|HERESY BEGETS RETRIBUTION|000011173004|Vow-sworn Crusaders Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Vow-sworn Crusaders|000001230|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8" of a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a surge move of up to D6".
SM|DREAD CRUSADERS|000011173002|Vow-sworn Crusaders Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Vow-sworn Crusaders|000001230|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Charge phase, when an enemy unit selects charge targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Adeptus Astartes Infantry unit that was selected as a charge target by that enemy unit this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That enemy unit must make a battle-shock roll, with -1 to that <b>battle-shock roll</b>.
SM|SPOOR OF THE UNHOLY|000011173005|Vow-sworn Crusaders Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Vow-sworn Crusaders|000001230|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit’s:<br><ul><li><b>BS</b> and <b>WS</b>.</li><li>Hit rolls.</li></ul>
SM|DEATH BEGETS VENGEANCE|000011088002|Wrath of the Doomed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Wrath of the Doomed|000001215|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly Death Company unit is destroyed by an enemy unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That enemy unit is hated until the end of the battle:<br><ul><li>While a unit is hated, friendly <span class="kwb">DEATH</span> <span class="kwb">COMPANY</span> units’ attacks that target that unit have +1 to wound rolls.</li></ul>
SM|NO BARRIER TO RETRIBUTION|000011088003|Wrath of the Doomed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Wrath of the Doomed|000001215|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement or your Charge phase, when a friendly Death Company Dreadnought unit is selected to make a normal/advance/charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DEATH</span> <span class="kwb">COMPANY</span> <span class="kwb">DREADNOUGHT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Mobile.
SM|RAGE-FUELLED RESPONSE|000011088004|Wrath of the Doomed Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Wrath of the Doomed|000001215|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged Death Company unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DEATH</span> <span class="kwb">COMPANY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a surge move of up to D6".
SM|IN SACRIFICE, VICTORY|000010161002|Wrath of the Rock Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Wrath of the Rock|000001059|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly Deathwing/Ravenwing unit within range of an objective is destroyed.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DEATHWING</span>/<span class="kwb">RAVENWING</span> unit. You can target that unit with this stratagem even though it is destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one <b>objective</b>:<br><ul><li>That no enemy units (excluding <span class="kwb">AIRCRAFT</span> units) are within range of.</li><li>That your unit was controlling at the end of the previous phase.</li></ul>That <b>objective</b> is secured.
SM|LION'S WILL|000010161003|Wrath of the Rock Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Wrath of the Rock|000001059|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> unit that is within range of an objective.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has +1 <b>OC</b> until the end of the turn.
SM|INESCAPABLE JUSTICE|000010161004|Wrath of the Rock Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Wrath of the Rock|000001059|<b>WHEN:</b> The Fight phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That Adeptus Astartes unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit's melee attacks have [Precision].
SM|TACTICAL MASTERY|000010161005|Wrath of the Rock Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Wrath of the Rock|000001059|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly Deathwing/Ravenwing unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one combat doctrine. That <b>combat doctrine</b> is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.
SM|KNIGHTS OF IRON|000010161006|Wrath of the Rock Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Wrath of the Rock|000001059|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement/Charge phase, when a friendly Ravenwing unit is selected to move or declares a charge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">RAVENWING</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Mobile.
SM|RELICS OF THE DARK AGE|000010161007|Wrath of the Rock Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Wrath of the Rock|000001059|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes Infantry/Mounted unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ADEPTUS</span> <span class="kwb">ASTARTES</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span>/<span class="kwb">MOUNTED</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have +2 <b>S</b>.
TAU|MICRODRONE SUPPORT|000010897003|Advanced Acquisition Cadre Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Advanced Acquisition Cadre|000001200|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly PATHFINDER TEAM/ STEALTH BATTLESUITS unit starts an action.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">PATHFINDER</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM/STEALTH</span> <span class="kwb">BATTLESUITS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That <b>action</b> does not prevent your unit from being eligible to shoot.
TAU|AUTOREACTIVE CAMOUFLAGE|000010897004|Advanced Acquisition Cadre Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Advanced Acquisition Cadre|000001200|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly PATHFINDER TEAM/ STEALTH BATTLESUITS unit, if that friendly unit is hidden.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">PATHFINDER</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM/STEALTH</span> <span class="kwb">BATTLESUITS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has +1 <b>Sv</b>.
TAU|MARKER BEACON|000010897002|Advanced Acquisition Cadre Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Advanced Acquisition Cadre|000001200|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly PATHFINDER TEAM/STEALTH BATTLESUITS unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective your unit is controlling. That <b>objective</b> is secured.
TAU|ALIEN EXPERTISE|000009840003|Auxiliary Cadre Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Auxiliary Cadre|000001005|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly KROOT/VESPID STINGWINGS unit is selected to make an advance move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KROOT/VESPID</span> <span class="kwb">STINGWINGS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to declare a charge.
TAU|EXPERIMENTAL MODIFICATIONS|000009840002|Auxiliary Cadre Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Auxiliary Cadre|000001005|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly KROOT/VESPID STINGWINGS unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KROOT/VESPID</span> <span class="kwb">STINGWINGS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks have +1 <b>AP</b>.
TAU|GUIDED BY UNITY|000009840004|Auxiliary Cadre Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Auxiliary Cadre|000001005|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly T’AU EMPIRE unit (excluding KROOT/VESPID STINGWINGS units) is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks that target a unit within 9" of a friendly <span class="kwb">KROOT/VESPID</span> <span class="kwb">STINGWINGS</span> unit have [LETHAL HITS].
TAU|EXPERIMENTAL AMMUNITION|000009984002|Experimental Prototype Cadre Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Experimental Prototype Cadre|000001028|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly BATTLESUIT CHARACTER unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">BATTLESUIT</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have:<br><ul><li>+1 <b>S</b>.</li><li><b><u>OR:</u></b> +1 <b>S</b>, <b>AP</b> and [HAZARDOUS].</li></ul>
TAU|POINT-BLANK AMBUSH|000008443003|Kauyon – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Kauyon|000000781|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within 9", improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds.
TAU|A TEMPTING TRAP|000008443002|Kauyon – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Kauyon|000000781|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. The first time you use this Stratagem, you must also select one objective marker that is not in your opponent’s deployment zone; until the end of the battle, this becomes your Trap objective marker.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within range of your Trap objective marker, add 1 to the Wound roll.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds.
TAU|WALL OF MIRRORS|000008443007|Kauyon – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Kauyon|000000781|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Stealth, Ghostkeel or Commander Shadowsun unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.
TAU|COORDINATE TO ENGAGE|000008443004|Kauyon – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Kauyon|000000781|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit from your army that has just been selected as an Observer unit (see For the Greater Good).<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets their Spotted unit, improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of that attack by 1 and, if your unit has the Markerlight keyword, that attack has the [IGNORES COVER] ability.
TAU|COMBAT EMBARKATION|000008443005|Kauyon – Wargear Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Kauyon|000000781|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Infantry unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge, and one friendly Transport.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can embark within that <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span>. If it does, your opponent can select new targets for that charge.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> Every model in your <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit must be within 3" of that <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> and there must be sufficient transport capacity to embark the entire unit.
TAU|PHOTON GRENADES|000008443006|Kauyon – Wargear Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Kauyon|000000781|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent's charge phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its charge target.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’AU EMPIRE GRENADES unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test, and until the end of the phase, subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that enemy unit. <br><br><b>RESTRICTION:</b> You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.
TAU|JOIN THE HUNT|000008822002|Kroot Hunting Pack – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Kroot Hunting Pack|000000847|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Kroot Infantry or Kroot Hounds unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed Character units to Attached units. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.
TAU|A TRAP WELL LAID|000008822003|Kroot Hunting Pack – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Kroot Hunting Pack|000000847|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Kroot unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> After your unit has resolved its attacks this phase, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time a <span class="kwb">KROOT</span> model from your army makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, unless the attacking unit is Battle-shocked, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.
TAU|HIDDEN HUNTERS|000008822007|Kroot Hunting Pack – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Kroot Hunting Pack|000000847|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Kroot unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18".
TAU|THE GRISLY FEAST|000008822005|Kroot Hunting Pack – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Kroot Hunting Pack|000000847|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Kroot unit from your army that destroyed one or more enemy units this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6" of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Stratagem do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase.
TAU|GUERRILLA WARRIORS|000008822006|Kroot Hunting Pack – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Kroot Hunting Pack|000000847|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a Kroot unit from your army Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KROOT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge.
TAU|EMP GRENADES|000008822004|Kroot Hunting Pack – Wargear Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Kroot Hunting Pack|000000847|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit is selected to shoot or fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Kroot Grenades unit from your army within 8" of that enemy <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, worsen the Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics of that enemy <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit’s weapons by 1.
TAU|BOARDING BLADES|000009646002|Kroot Raiding Party – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Kroot Raiding Party|000000967|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One KROOT unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in your unit by 1. In addition, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, on a Critical Wound, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by an additional 1.
TAU|BRUTE FORCE|000009646004|Kroot Raiding Party – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Kroot Raiding Party|000000967|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a KROOTOX RIDERS unit from your army opens a Hatchway.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">KROOTOX</span> <span class="kwb">RIDERS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Roll one D6 for each unit that is within 3" of that Hatchway, if that Hatchway is visible to that unit and that unit is wholly on the opposite side of it from your unit: on a 2-4, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound; on a 5+, that enemy unit suffers 2 mortal wounds.
TAU|SWEEPING AMBUSH|000009646003|Kroot Raiding Party – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Kroot Raiding Party|000000967|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One KROOT unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6" instead of up to 3". In addition, when making a Consolidation move, that model can end that move within Engagement Range of the closest enemy unit that was not visible to its unit when it started that move.
TAU|TANGLEBOMB BOLAS|000009646005|Kroot Raiding Party – Wargear Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Kroot Raiding Party|000000967|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One KROOT unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit within 9" of and visible to your unit and roll one D6: on a 2+, until the start of your next Shooting phase, halve the Move characteristic of models in that enemy unit and halve Advance and Charge rolls made for it.
TAU|FOCUSED FIRE|000008812004|Mont’ka – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Mont’ka|000000845|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Two <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> units from your army that have not been selected to shoot this phase, and one enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in either of your units makes an attack, it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target for that attack), and when resolving that attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic by 1.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot use this Stratagem during the fourth or fifth battle rounds.
TAU|PINPOINT COUNTER-OFFENSIVE|000008812002|Mont’ka – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Mont’ka|000000845|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit (excluding Kroot units) from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the battle, each time a <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit (excluding <span class="kwb">KROOT</span> units) from your army makes an attack that targets the enemy unit that just destroyed your unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll.
TAU|AGGRESSIVE MOBILITY|000008812003|Mont’ka – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Mont’ka|000000845|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, if your unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6" to the Move characteristic of models in your unit.
TAU|COMBAT DEBARKATION|000008812005|Mont’ka – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Mont’ka|000000845|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Infantry unit from your army that disembarked from a <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> this turn.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets the closest enemy unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll.
TAU|PULSE ONSLAUGHT|000008812006|Mont’ka – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|2|Your turn|Shooting phase|Mont’ka|000000845|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Infantry unit (excluding Kroot units) from your army that has just shot, and one enemy unit (excluding <span class="kwb">MONSTERS</span> and <span class="kwb">VEHICLES</span>) hit by one or more of those attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of your opponent’s next turn, that enemy unit is shaken. While a unit is shaken, subtract 2 from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Advance and Charge rolls made for it.
TAU|COUNTERFIRE DEFENCE SYSTEMS|000008812007|Mont’ka – Wargear Stratagem|2|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Mont’ka|000000845|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.
TAU|THE ARRO’KON PROTOCOL|000008816005|Retaliation Cadre – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Retaliation Cadre|000000846|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Battlesuit unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that contains 6 or more models, that attack has the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. If that attack targets an enemy unit that contains 11 or more models, it has the [SUSTAINED HITS 2] ability instead.
TAU|FAIL-SAFE DETONATOR|000008816002|Retaliation Cadre – Epic Deed Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Retaliation Cadre|000000846|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just after a T’au Empire Battlesuit model from your army is destroyed.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That destroyed model’s unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even if that unit was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Before removing your model from play, if it has the Deadly Demise ability, do not roll for that ability; instead, you can choose whether the result of that roll is a 1 or a 6. If your model does not have the Deadly Demise ability, roll one D6 for each unit within 6" of it: on a 4+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
TAU|THE TORCHSTAR GAMBIT|000008816006|Retaliation Cadre – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Retaliation Cadre|000000846|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Battlesuit unit from your army that can <span class="kwb">FLY</span> whose attacks have been resolved this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move. If it does, your unit cannot declare a charge this turn
TAU|THE SHORTENED BLADE|000008816004|Retaliation Cadre – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|2|Your turn|Movement phase|Retaliation Cadre|000000846|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Battlesuit unit from your army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy models.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> A unit targeted with this Stratagem is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn.
TAU|GRAV-INHIBITOR FIELD|000008816007|Retaliation Cadre – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Retaliation Cadre|000000846|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Battlesuit unit from your army that was selected as a target of that charge.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test and you must roll one D6 for each model in that enemy unit: for each 6, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
TAU|STIMM INJECTORS|000008816003|Retaliation Cadre – Wargear Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Retaliation Cadre|000000846|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One T’au Empire Battlesuit unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability.
TAU|RESPONSIVE VOLLEY|000009637004|Starfire Cadre – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Starfire Cadre|000000966|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a FIRE WARRIOR or PATHfINDER TEAM unit from your army opens a Hatchway.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">FIRE</span> <span class="kwb">WARRIOR</span> or <span class="kwb">PATHFINDER</span> <span class="kwb">TEAM</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit wholly on the opposite side of that Hatchway from them, a Critical Hit is scored on an unmodified Hit roll of 5+, instead of only a 6.
TAU|PULSE BARRAGE|000009637005|Starfire Cadre – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement or Charge phase|Starfire Cadre|000000966|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement or Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One FIRE WARRIOR or PATHfINDER TEAM unit from your army that has not fired Overwatch this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack while firing Overwatch, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ is required to score a hit, instead of an unmodified 6.
TAU|FIRING LINE|000009637002|Starfire Cadre – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Starfire Cadre|000000966|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit destroys a <span class="kwb">T’AU</span> <span class="kwb">EMPIRE</span> unit from your army.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One FIRE WARRIOR or PATHfINDER TEAM unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, has not fired Overwatch this turn and is within 9" of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but when doing so, models in your unit can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target) and, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ is required to score a hit.
TAU|RETREATING FIRE|000009637003|Starfire Cadre – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Starfire Cadre|000000966|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One FIRE WARRIOR or PATHfINDER TEAM unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Fell Back.
TS|SULPHUROUS VEIL|000010198002|Changehost of Deceit – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Changehost of Deceit|000001062|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons or Scintillating Legions unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.
TS|DECEPTIVE GLAMOUR|000010198003|Changehost of Deceit – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Changehost of Deceit|000001062|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy model within Engagement Range of your unit selects targets for its attacks, it can only target your unit if there are no eligible Scintillating Legions targets for those attacks.
TS|CHRONOSORCEROUS BLEED|000010198006|Changehost of Deceit – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Changehost of Deceit|000001062|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your opponent’s Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged THOUSAND SONS PSYKER/SCINTILLATING LEGIONS unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one visible enemy unit within 12" of your unit. When that enemy unit declares a charge, that enemy unit has -1 to charge rolls.
TS|ETHEREAL PHANTASM|000010198004|Changehost of Deceit – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Changehost of Deceit|000001062|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Scintillating Legions unit from your army that is within 8" of that enemy unit and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6", or a Normal move of up to 6" instead if it is wholly within 6" of one or more friendly Thousand Sons units.
TS|FRACTAL DISJUNCTION|000010198005|Changehost of Deceit – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Changehost of Deceit|000001062|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Scintillating Legions unit from your army (excluding Monsters) that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18".
TS|GLIMMERSHIFT PORTAL|000010198007|Changehost of Deceit – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Changehost of Deceit|000001062|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two Scintillating Legions units from your army (excluding Monsters), or one Scintillating Legions Monster unit from your army, if all of those units are more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove those units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves.
TS|TZEENTCH’S BOON|000009655005|Chosen Cabal – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Chosen Cabal|000000969|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER model from your army within range of an objective marker that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your model makes a Psychic Attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll.
TS|EMPYRIC DESECRATION|000009655003|Chosen Cabal – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Fight phase|Chosen Cabal|000000969|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER CHARAcTER model from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective marker Secured by your opponent’s army that is within 6" of and visible to your model, then roll one D6: on a 2+, that objective marker is no longer considered Secured by your opponent’s army.
TS|COSTLY BLESSING|000009655002|Chosen Cabal – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Chosen Cabal|000000969|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER CHARAcTER model from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks. <br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, your model has a 3+ invulnerable save. At the end of the phase, your model suffers D3 mortal wounds.
TS|INFERNO BOLTERS|000009655004|Chosen Cabal – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Chosen Cabal|000000969|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One RUBRIc MARINES or ScARAB OccULT TERMINATORS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one closed Hatchway. Until the end of the phase, models in your unit can make attacks with ranged weapons (excluding Torrent weapons) that target enemy units within 1" of that Hatchway and that are wholly on the opposite side of it from your unit, as if that Hatchway was open. Each time a model does so, that attack has an Armour Penetration characteristic of 0.
TS|FLESH CHANGE|000009664003|Devoted Thralls – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Devoted Thralls|000000970|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One TzAANGORS unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability.
TS|PSYCHIC INGRESS|000009664002|Devoted Thralls – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Devoted Thralls|000000970|<b>WHEN:</b> End of any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER CHARAcTER model from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Open every Hatchway within 3" of your model. When measuring this distance, ignore Walls and closed Hatchways.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You can only use this Stratagem once.
TS|BESTIAL SURGE|000009664005|Devoted Thralls – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Devoted Thralls|000000970|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One TzAANGORS unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a Bestial Surge move. To do so, roll one D6: your unit can be moved a distance in inches up to the result, but must end that move as close as possible to the attacking unit. When doing so, those models can be moved within Engagement Range of that enemy unit, but only that enemy unit.
TS|FELL SACRIFICE|000009664004|Devoted Thralls – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Command phase|Devoted Thralls|000000970|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Command phase, at the start of the Battle-shock step.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS CHARAcTER or TzAANGORS unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit below its Starting Strength that is within Engagement Range of your unit. That enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test. If that enemy unit is also Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. This Enhancement cannot cause a unit to take two Battle-shock tests in the same phase.
TS|STRATEGIC VISION|000009673003|Fateseekers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Fateseekers|000000971|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units and has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PISTOL] ability, and models in your unit can target enemy units that are not within Engagement Range of them (as long as they are otherwise eligible targets).
TS|PHANTASMIC MUNITIONS|000009673004|Fateseekers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Fateseekers|000000971|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit can ignore enemy models for the purposes of determining visibility.
TS|ENDURING ANIMUS|000009673002|Fateseekers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Fateseekers|000000971|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">THOUSAND</span> <span class="kwb">SONS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6. On a 4+, do not remove the destroyed model from play; it can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.
TS|INVISIBLE ASSAILANTS|000009673005|Fateseekers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Fateseekers|000000971|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your opponent’s Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER model from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit visible to your model. That unit must take a Leadership test, subtracting 1 from the result: if failed, until the start of your opponent’s next Movement phase, subtract 2" from the Move characteristic of models in that unit and subtract 2 from Advance and Charge rolls made for it; if passed, subtract 1" from the Move characteristic of models in that unit and subtract 1 from Advance and Charge rolls made for it.
TS|DEVASTATING SORCERY|000010194007|Grand Coven – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Your turn|Shooting phase|Grand Coven|000001061|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, add 9" to the Range characteristic of Psychic weapons equipped by models in your unit, and each time a model in your unit makes an attack with a Psychic weapon, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll.
TS|DESECRATION OF WORLDS|000010194005|Grand Coven – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Grand Coven|000001061|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
TS|ARCANE FOCUS|000010194006|Grand Coven – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Grand Coven|000001061|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, just after you take a Psychic test for a Thousand Sons model from your army that Channelled the Warp (before resolving that Ritual).<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">THOUSAND</span> <span class="kwb">SONS</span> model.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Re-roll all of the D6 rolled for that Psychic test (including the additional D6 for Channelling the Warp).
TS|PSYCHIC DOMINION|000010194002|Grand Coven – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Grand Coven|000001061|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, all attacks made against your unit with Psychic weapons have the [hazardous] ability and all models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against Psychic Attacks.
TS|DESTINED BY FATE|000010194003|Grand Coven – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Grand Coven|000001061|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just after a saving throw is failed for a Thousand Sons Psyker model from your army. If you are using fast dice rolling, this Stratagem can still be used after rolling multiple saving throws at once.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> model.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 0. If you are using fast dice rolling, select one of those attacks you failed a saving throw for.
TS|EGOTISTICAL POWER|000010194004|Grand Coven – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Grand Coven|000001061|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select the Imbued Manifestation, Psychic Maelstrom or Wrath of the Immaterium ability. Until the start of your next Command phase, that ability applies to your unit instead of any other Kindred Sorcery ability, even if you have already selected that ability this battle.
TS|KALEIDOSCOPIC TEMPEST|000009742007|Hexwarp Thrallband – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Hexwarp Thrallband|000000983|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><ul><li>Your unit has Stealth.</li><li>If your unit is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic, your unit has ‐3 detection range.</li></ul>
TS|WARDING HEX|000009742002|Hexwarp Thrallband – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Hexwarp Thrallband|000000983|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control, if that objective marker is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
TS|THROUGH THE VEIL|000009742005|Hexwarp Thrallband – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Hexwarp Thrallband|000000983|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of the Reinforcements step of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Rubric Marines or Scarab Occult Terminators unit from your army that is in Strategic Reserves.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> If it is a <span class="kwb">RUBRIC</span> <span class="kwb">MARINES</span> unit, until the end of the phase, it has the Deep Strike ability. When your unit is set up on the battlefield using the Deep Strike ability, if it is a <span class="kwb">SCARAB</span> <span class="kwb">OCCULT</span> <span class="kwb">TERMINATOR</span> unit it can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic and more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy models.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> If a <span class="kwb">SCARAB</span> <span class="kwb">OCCULT</span> <span class="kwb">TERMINATORS</span> unit is targeted with this Stratagem, it is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn.
TS|STRANDS OF TIME|000009742004|Hexwarp Thrallband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Hexwarp Thrallband|000000983|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a <span class="kwb">THOUSAND</span> <span class="kwb">SONS</span> <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> unit from your army Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That Thousand Sons Psyker unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot or declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back. If your unit is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic when it is targeted with this Stratagem, then until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.
TS|WRATH OF THE DOOMED|000009742003|Hexwarp Thrallband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Hexwarp Thrallband|000000983|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">THOUSAND</span> <span class="kwb">SONS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if your unit is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic: on a 4+, do not remove it from play. That destroyed model can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.
TS|SCOURING WARPFLAME|000009742006|Hexwarp Thrallband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Hexwarp Thrallband|000000983|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase and is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability. After your unit has shot this phase, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, models in that unit cannot have the Benefit of Cover.
TS|MULTITUDINOUS LIMBS|000010965004|Ritual of Regeneration Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Ritual of Regeneration|000001170|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly INFANTRY/MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit is selected to make an advance/fall back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">INFANTRY/MOUNTED</span> <span class="kwb">THOUSAND</span> <span class="kwb">SONS</span> <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to start an action.
TS|RELENTLESS REBIRTH|000010965002|Ritual of Regeneration Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Ritual of Regeneration|000001170|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly INFANTRY/MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">INFANTRY/MOUNTED</span> <span class="kwb">THOUSAND</span> <span class="kwb">SONS</span> <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 5+ against <b>mortal wounds</b>.
TS|MUTAGENIC MAGICKS|000010965003|Ritual of Regeneration Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Ritual of Regeneration|000001170|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly engaged THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Start of the Fight phase. One friendly engaged Thousand Sons Psyker unit. Select one enemy unit engaged with your unit. Roll six D6: For each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
TS|UNWAVERING PHALANX|000010206007|Rubricae Phalanx – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Rubricae Phalanx|000001064|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Rubric Marines unit from your army within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, attacks that target your unit with a <b>S</b> greater than your unit’s <b>T</b> have -1 to wound rolls.
TS|REVENGE OF THE RUBRICAE|000010206005|Rubricae Phalanx – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Rubricae Phalanx|000001064|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after a Thousand Sons Psyker model from your army is destroyed.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Rubricae unit from your army that was within 6" of that <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> model when it was destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> After the attacking unit has shot, your <span class="kwb">RUBRICAE</span> unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but when resolving those attacks it can only target the enemy unit that just destroyed your <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> model (and only if it is an eligible target).
TS|IMPLACABLE GUARDIANS|000010206006|Rubricae Phalanx – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|2|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Rubricae Phalanx|000001064|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Rubric Marines Psyker unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit (excluding <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> models), subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.
TS|INEXORABLE ADVANCE|000010206003|Rubricae Phalanx – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Rubricae Phalanx|000001064|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Rubricae unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit can ignore any or all modifiers to its Move characteristic and to Advance rolls made for it, and ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [ASSAULT] ability.
TS|ARDENT AUTOMATA|000010206002|Rubricae Phalanx – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Rubricae Phalanx|000001064|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a Rubricae unit from your army Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">RUBRICAE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.
TS|INFERNAL FUSILLADE|000010206004|Rubricae Phalanx – Wargear Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Rubricae Phalanx|000001064|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, all inferno bolt pistols, inferno boltguns, inferno combi-bolters and inferno combi-weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PSYCHIC] ability.
TS|ECTOPLASMIC EXTRUSION|000010969003|Sekhetar Cohort Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Sekhetar Cohort|000001171|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly SEKHETAR ROBOTS unit within 12" of a friendly THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit starts an action.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SEKHETAR</span> <span class="kwb">ROBOTS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That action does not prevent your unit from being eligible to shoot.
TS|ARCANE VENTING|000010969002|Sekhetar Cohort Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Sekhetar Cohort|000001171|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly SEKHETAR ROBOTS unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective your unit is controlling. That objective is secured.
TS|WARP FIELDS|000010969004|Sekhetar Cohort Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Sekhetar Cohort|000001171|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly SEKHETAR ROBOTS unit within 12" of a friendly THOUSAND SONS PSYKER unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">SEKHETAR</span> <span class="kwb">ROBOTS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Ranged attacks that target your unit with a <b>S</b> greater than your unit’s <b>T</b> have -1 to wound rolls.
TS|THE LAND WRITHES|000010973004|Servants of Change Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Servants of Change|000001172|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly MONSTER MUTANT unit is selected to move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> <span class="kwb">MUTANT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has MOBILE.
TS|TEMPORAL INSTABILITY|000010973003|Servants of Change Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Servants of Change|000001172|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly INFANTRY/MOUNTED MUTANT unit is selected to make an advance/fall back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">INFANTRY/MOUNTED</span> <span class="kwb">MUTANT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> In a turn your unit made an <b>advance/fall-back move</b>, that move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to start an action.
TS|PRISMATIC DISPLACEMENT|000010973002|Servants of Change Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Servants of Change|000001172|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly INFANTRY/MOUNTED MUTANT unit is selected to make an advance/fall back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">INFANTRY/MOUNTED</span> <span class="kwb">MUTANT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b><br><ul><li>Your unit’s ranged attacks have [ASSAULT] until the end of the turn.</li><li>That move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to shoot/declare a charge.</li></ul>
TS|ENSORCELLED INFUSION|000010210006|Warpforged Cabal – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Your turn|Shooting phase|Warpforged Cabal|000001065|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Vehicle unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase, that is within 6" of one or more friendly Thousand Sons Psyker units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> models in your unit have the [PSYCHIC] ability and each time an attack is made with such a weapon, add 1 to the Wound roll.
TS|HEX-MARKED ARMOUR|000010210002|Warpforged Cabal – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Warpforged Cabal|000001065|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Vehicle unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.
TS|MUTATE LANDSCAPE|000010210003|Warpforged Cabal – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Warpforged Cabal|000001065|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That objective marker is mutated, and remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase. While an objective marker is mutated and under your control, each time an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move within range of that objective marker, roll one D6: on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
TS|MALEVOLENT ANIMUS|000010210005|Warpforged Cabal – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Warpforged Cabal|000001065|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Vehicle unit from your army within 6" of one or more friendly Thousand Sons Psyker units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, your <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit is malevolent. While a unit is malevolent, it can ignore any or all modifiers to the following: the profile characteristics of its models; the Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics of weapons equipped by its models; any roll or test made for it (excluding modifiers to saving throws).
TS|CYBERSPIRIT MACHINATIONS|000010210004|Warpforged Cabal – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Warpforged Cabal|000001065|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a Thousand Sons Vehicle unit from your army Falls Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit, and one friendly Thousand Sons Psyker unit within 6" of that <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.
TS|WARPFLAME GARGOYLES|000010210007|Warpforged Cabal – Wargear Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Charge phase|Warpforged Cabal|000001065|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Vehicle unit from your army within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Roll six D6: for each 5+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. That enemy unit must then take a Battle-shock test.
TS|GIFT OF CHANGE|000010202002|Warpmeld Pact – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Warpmeld Pact|000001063|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Character model from your army (excluding Monsters) that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> At the end of the phase, add one Tzeentch Chaos Spawn unit containing one model to your army, and set it up as close as possible to where your model was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You can only use this Stratagem once per battle round.
TS|DERANGED FEROCITY|000010202004|Warpmeld Pact – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Warpmeld Pact|000001063|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after a Tzeentch Mutant unit from your army is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TZEENTCH</span> <span class="kwb">MUTANT</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6" instead of up to 3", and when determining which models in it are eligible to fight, any models in it that are within 3" of one or more enemy models are eligible to fight. When resolving those attacks, such models can target one of those enemy units that is within 3" of them and within Engagement Range of their unit.
TS|BLESSED TRANSMUTATIONS|000010202005|Warpmeld Pact – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Warpmeld Pact|000001063|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Thousand Sons Psyker model from your army, and one friendly Tzaangors unit that is below its Starting Strength and within 12" of that <span class="kwb">PSYKER</span> model.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Return up to D3+1 destroyed models (excluding Characters) to your <span class="kwb">TZAANGORS</span> unit.
TS|TOUCHED BY TZEENTCH|000010202006|Warpmeld Pact – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Warpmeld Pact|000001063|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tzeentch Mutant unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot or declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.
TS|TWISTED MIRAGE|000010202007|Warpmeld Pact – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Warpmeld Pact|000001063|<b>WHEN:</b> Reinforcements step of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tzeentch Mutant unit from your army that is arriving from Strategic Reserves this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy units, or anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8" horizontally away from all enemy units if it is a Monster unit. In either case, until the end of the turn, it is not eligible to declare a charge.
TS|WARPED VICISSITUDE|000010202003|Warpmeld Pact – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Warpmeld Pact|000001063|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tzaangors unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save.
TYR|SCANNER GHEIST|000010937004|Ambush Predators Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Ambush Predators|000001197|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly unengaged DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/ NEUROLICTOR unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Place your unit in strategic reserves.
TYR|HYPERSENSORY ADAPTATIONS|000010937003|Ambush Predators Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Ambush Predators|000001197|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/NEUROLICTOR/VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one visible enemy unit within 12" of your unit. That enemy unit has +6" detection range.
TYR|COUNTERPREDATION|000010937002|Ambush Predators Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Ambush Predators|000001197|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/ NEUROLICTOR/VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/NEUROLICTOR/VON</span> <span class="kwb">RYAN’S</span> <span class="kwb">LEAPERS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks that target a hidden unit have +1 <b>S</b> and <b>AP</b>.
TYR|RAPACIOUS HUNGER|000008413007|Assimilation Swarm – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Fight phase|Assimilation Swarm|000000771|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that just destroyed an enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit immediately Regenerates (See Feed the Swarm). When doing so, if your unit is a Harvester unit and you choose for one model to regain up to D3 lost wounds, that model regains up to 3 lost wounds instead.
TYR|BROODGUARD IMPULSE|000008413002|Assimilation Swarm – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Assimilation Swarm|000000771|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Harvester unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the battle, each time a friendly <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> model makes an attack that targets the enemy unit that just destroyed your <span class="kwb">HARVESTER</span> unit, add 1 to the Wound roll.
TYR|ABLATIVE CARAPACE|000008413005|Assimilation Swarm – Epic Deed Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Assimilation Swarm|000000771|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Harvester unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability. If your unit is within range of an objective marker you control, until the end of the phase models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability instead.
TYR|TYRANNOFORMED|000008413004|Assimilation Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Assimilation Swarm|000000771|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Harvester unit from your army that is within range of an objective marker you control.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
TYR|RECLAIM BIOMASS|000008413003|Assimilation Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Assimilation Swarm|000000771|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army is destroyed, before the last model in it is removed from play.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Harvester unit from your army that is within 6" of that destroyed unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Regenerate one friendly <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit within 6" of your <span class="kwb">HARVESTER</span> unit (See Feed the Swarm).
TYR|SECURE BIOMASS|000008413006|Assimilation Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Assimilation Swarm|000000771|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability. If your unit is a Harvester unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, a successful unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit as well.
TYR|ONRUSHING HORDE|000009700005|Biotide – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Biotide|000000975|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army (excluding WINGED TYRANID PRIME units), that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.
TYR|SWARM HUNTERS|000009700004|Biotide – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Biotide|000000975|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One TERMAGANTs unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit can ignore other models in their unit for the purposes of determining visibility. In addition, if your unit is within Synapse Range of your army, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Hit roll.
TYR|SQUIRMING MASSES|000009700003|Biotide – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Biotide|000000975|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, at the start of the Reinforcements step.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One ENDLESS MULTITUDE unit from your army that is in Reserves.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Deep Strike ability and, when setting them upon the battlefield using that ability, they can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy units, provided they are also within Synapse Range of your army.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You can only use this Stratagem once and, until the end of the turn, your unit is not eligible to declare a charge.
TYR|LIVING AVALANCHE|000009700002|Biotide – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Biotide|000000975|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army has opened a Hatchway.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a Swarm move. To do so, your unit can be moved up to 3", but at least one model from your unit must end that move on the opposite side of that Hatchway from the one it started the phase on. When doing so, those models can be moved within Engagement Range of enemy units.
TYR|LITHE KILLERS|000009691002|Boarding Swarm – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Boarding Swarm|000000974|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 5+ invulnerable save.
TYR|TALON-TIP SWARM|000009691004|Boarding Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Boarding Swarm|000000974|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after a <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army destroys an enemy unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 3". After that move, if your unit is within range of an objective marker and no enemy units are within range of that objective marker, that objective marker is Secured by your army.
TYR|ADRENALISED SLAUGHTER|000009691003|Boarding Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Boarding Swarm|000000974|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6. On a 5+, do not remove the destroyed model from play; it can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.
TYR|PREDATORY POUNCE|000009691005|Boarding Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Boarding Swarm|000000974|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit opens a Hatchway.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that is within 3" of that Hatchway and is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a Pounce move. To do so, your unit can be moved up to 3", but must end that move as close as possible to that Hatchway. When doing so, those models can be moved within Engagement Range of that enemy unit, but only that enemy unit.
TYR|RAMPAGING MONSTROSITIES|000008422003|Crusher Stampede – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Crusher Stampede|000000769|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids Monster unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Hit roll.
TYR|SAVAGE ROAR|000008422004|Crusher Stampede – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Crusher Stampede|000000769|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids Monster unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> That enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test and, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that enemy unit makes an attack that targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll. If that Battle-shock test was failed, subtract 1 from the Wound roll as well.
TYR|SWARM-GUIDED SALVOES|000008422006|Crusher Stampede – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Crusher Stampede|000000769|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids Monster unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability, and until the end of the phase each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that model’s Ballistic Skill characteristic and any or all modifiers to the Hit roll.
TYR|MASSIVE IMPACT|000008422007|Crusher Stampede – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Crusher Stampede|000000769|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase, just after a Tyranids Monster model from your army ends a Charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> model.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of your model and roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
TYR|CORROSIVE VISCERA|000008422002|Crusher Stampede – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Crusher Stampede|000000769|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after a Tyranids Monster model from your army with the Deadly Demise ability that cannot <span class="kwb">FLY</span> is destroyed.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> model. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Do not roll one D6 to determine whether mortal wounds are inflicted by your model’s Deadly Demise ability. Instead, mortal wounds are automatically inflicted.
TYR|UNTRAMMELLED FEROCITY|000008422005|Crusher Stampede – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Crusher Stampede|000000769|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids Monster unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, it can move through models (excluding <span class="kwb">TITANIC</span> models) and sections of terrain features that are 4" or less in height. When doing so: <br><ul><li>It can move within Engagement Range of enemy models, but cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them. </li><li>It can also move through sections of terrain features that are more than 4" in height, but if it does, after its unit has moved, roll one D6: on a 1, your unit is Battle-shocked.</li></ul>
TYR|HYPERADRENAL REFLEXES|000009725002|Infestation Swarm – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Infestation Swarm|000000979|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One GREAT DEVOURER unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save.
TYR|PERVASIVE DREAD|000009725003|Infestation Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Infestation Swarm|000000979|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after the enemy <span class="kwb">WARLORD</span> is destroyed (and is not returned to the battlefield) by a GREAT DEVOURER unit from your army.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">GREAT</span> <span class="kwb">DEVOURER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit on the battlefield must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from the result. This Stratagem cannot cause a unit to take two Battle-shock tests in the same phase.
TYR|HUNTING GROUNDS|000009725004|Infestation Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Infestation Swarm|000000979|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a GREAT DEVOURER unit from your army opens a Hatchway.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">GREAT</span> <span class="kwb">DEVOURER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 3", provided at least one of its models ends that move on the opposite side of that Hatchway from when your unit opened it.
TYR|OUTFLANK|000009725005|Infestation Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Infestation Swarm|000000979|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One GENESTEALERs or PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS unit from your army that is wholly within an Entry Zone.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves. It will arrive back on the battlefield in the Reinforcements step of your next Movement phase. When doing so, if it was within one of your Entry Zones when it was removed, it must be set up wholly within another one of your Entry Zones. If it was within one of your opponent’s Entry Zones when it was removed, it must be set up wholly within another one of your opponent’s Entry Zones instead. If this is not possible, your unit is destroyed.
TYR|ADRENAL SURGE|000008349003|Invasion Fleet – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Invasion Fleet|000000748|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> units from your army that are within Synapse Range of your army and are eligible to fight, or one other <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that is eligible to fight.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in any of those selected units makes an attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.
TYR|RAPID REGENERATION|000008349002|Invasion Fleet – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Invasion Fleet|000000748|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability. If your unit is within Synapse Range of your army, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability instead.
TYR|DEATH FRENZY|000008349004|Invasion Fleet – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Invasion Fleet|000000748|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 4+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.
TYR|OVERRUN|000008349005|Invasion Fleet – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Invasion Fleet|000000748|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just before a <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army Consolidates.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your unit Consolidates, models in it can move an additional 3" as long as your unit can end that move within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units. If your unit is within Synapse Range of your army and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, instead of making that Consolidation move, it can make a Normal move of up to 6".
TYR|PREDATORY IMPERATIVE|000008349006|Invasion Fleet – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Invasion Fleet|000000748|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> units from your army that are within Synapse Range of your army, or one other <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one Hyper-adaptation. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Hyper-adaptation is active for those selected units in addition to any other that may be active for your army.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot select the same Hyper-adaptation you selected at the start of the first battle round.
TYR|ENDLESS SWARM|000008349007|Invasion Fleet – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Invasion Fleet|000000748|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two Endless Multitude units from your army that are within Synapse Range of your army, or one other <span class="kwb">ENDLESS</span> <span class="kwb">MULTITUDE</span> unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> You can return up to D3+3 destroyed models to each of the selected units.
TYR|RETREAT BELOW|000010148007|Subterranean Assault – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Subterranean Assault|000001057|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids unit or up to two Burrower units from your army that are not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.
TYR|ENFILADING EMERGENCE|000010148004|Subterranean Assault – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Subterranean Assault|000001057|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids unit from your army that was set up as Reinforcements this turn.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of your next Fight phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] and [IGNORES COVER] abilities.
TYR|TUNNEL NETWORK|000010148005|Subterranean Assault – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Subterranean Assault|000001057|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids unit from your army that is wholly within 9" of one or more of your Tunnel Markers and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove your unit from the battlefield and set it up again, wholly within 9" of another Tunnel Marker you placed, and more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy units.
TYR|SWARMING ASSAULT|000010148006|Subterranean Assault – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Subterranean Assault|000001057|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids Monster unit from your army that was set up as Reinforcements this turn.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, friendly Tyranids units within 6" of your unit can re-roll Charge rolls.
TYR|ADAPTIVE OPTIMISATION|000010148002|Subterranean Assault – Wargear Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Subterranean Assault|000001057|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Mawloc or Trygon unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, your unit has the Synapse keyword.
TYR|REPLENISHING SWARMS|000010148003|Subterranean Assault – Wargear Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Subterranean Assault|000001057|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Tyranids unit from your army, wholly within 9" of one or more Tunnel Markers you placed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> One model in your unit regains up to D3+1 lost wounds, or you can return up to D3+1 destroyed models with a Wounds characteristic of 1 to your unit, with their full wounds remaining, instead.
TYR|IRRESISTIBLE WILL|000008556004|Synaptic Nexus – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Synaptic Nexus|000000773|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Synapse unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase, and one enemy unit within 24" of and visible to the <span class="kwb">SYNAPSE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> model makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, if the attacking model’s unit is within 6" of your <span class="kwb">SYNAPSE</span> unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and re-roll a Wound roll of 1.
TYR|SYNAPTIC CHANNELLING|000008556003|Synaptic Nexus – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Command phase|Synaptic Nexus|000000773|<b>WHEN:</b> Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Synapse unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, while a friendly <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit is within 9" of the selected unit, that unit is within Synapse Range of your army.
TYR|REINFORCED HIVE NODE|000008556005|Synaptic Nexus – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Synaptic Nexus|000000773|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Synapse unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.
TYR|IMPERATIVE DOMINANCE|000008556006|Synaptic Nexus – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Synaptic Nexus|000000773|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that is within Synapse Range of your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one Synaptic Imperative, even if you have already selected that imperative this battle. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Synaptic Imperative is active for your unit instead of any other Synaptic Imperative that is active for your army.
TYR|OVERRIDE INSTINCTS|000008556007|Synaptic Nexus – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Synaptic Nexus|000000773|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that is within Synapse Range of your army and made a Fall Back move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge this turn.
TYR|THE SMOTHERING SHADOW|000008556002|Synaptic Nexus – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Synaptic Nexus|000000773|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just after an enemy unit fails a Battle-shock test.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Synapse unit from your army within 12" of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Roll six D6: for each 3+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
TYR|TANGLESTRIKE ROUNDS|000010941004|Talons of the Norn Queen Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Talons of the Norn Queen|000001198|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly NORN ASSIMILATOR unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">NORN</span> <span class="kwb">ASSIMILATOR</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit is <b>tethered</b> until the start of your next Command phase:<br><ul><li>While a unit is <b>tethered</b>, that unit has -2" <b>M</b>.</li></ul>
TYR|CATALYTIC BIOFORTIFICATION|000010941002|Talons of the Norn Queen Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Talons of the Norn Queen|000001198|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly NORN ASSIMILATOR unit suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That NORN ASSIMILATOR unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 4+ against mortal wounds.
TYR|LESSER PREY|000010941003|Talons of the Norn Queen Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Talons of the Norn Queen|000001198|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly NORN ASSIMILATOR/NORN EMISSARY unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">NORN</span> <span class="kwb">ASSIMILATOR/NORN</span> <span class="kwb">EMISSARY</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have +2 <b>S</b>.
TYR|BIO-ACID SURGE|000009682002|Tyranid Attack – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Tyranid Attack|000000973|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that is within Synapse Range of your army and has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability.
TYR|EXPENDABLE BIOMASS|000009682004|Tyranid Attack – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Tyranid Attack|000000973|WHEN: Your Shooting phase.<br><br>TARGET: One TYRANID WARRIORS wITH RANGED BIO-wEAPONS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br>EFFECT: Select one enemy unit that is visible to your unit and within Engagement Range of one or more friendly ENDLESS MULTITUDE or RIPPER SwARMS units. Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to make ranged attacks against that enemy unit as if it was not within Engagement Range of those friendly units. When doing so, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll and, after your unit has finished making its attacks, each of those friendly units that started the phase within Engagement Range of that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
TYR|HIVE SIGHT|000009682005|Tyranid Attack – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Charge phase|Tyranid Attack|000000973|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One TYRANIDS SYNAPSE unit from your army and one friendly <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit that has not declared a charge this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit that is visible to your SYNAPSE unit. Until the end of the phase, each time your other unit declares a charge, it can include that enemy unit as a target of that charge, even if it is not visible to it, and when doing so, add 1 to the Charge roll.
TYR|PHAGIC SPORES|000009682003|Tyranid Attack – Wargear Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Tyranid Attack|000000973|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One TYRANID WARRIORS wITH MELEE BIO-wEAPONS or TYRANID WARRIORS wITH RANGED BIO-wEAPONS unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed as a result of an attack, do not remove it from play; after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, roll one D6: on a 3-5, the closest enemy unit within 3" of and visible to your unit suffers 1 mortal wound; on a 6, the closest enemy unit within 3" of and visible to your unit suffers 2 mortal wounds. The destroyed model is then removed from play.
TYR|TEEMING MASSES|000008409004|Unending Swarm – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Unending Swarm|000000770|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Endless Multitude unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.
TYR|SWARMING MASSES|000008409005|Unending Swarm – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Unending Swarm|000000770|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Endless Multitude unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability, and If your unit contains 15 or more models, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.
TYR|BOUNDING ADVANCE|000008409006|Unending Swarm – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Unending Swarm|000000770|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Endless Multitude unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6" to the Move characteristic of models in your unit.
TYR|SYNAPTIC GOADING|000008409002|Unending Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Unending Swarm|000000770|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, just before an Endless Multitude unit from your army that is within Synapse Range of your army makes a surge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">ENDLESS</span> <span class="kwb">MULTITUDE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When making that <b>surge move</b>, you can re-roll the D6 to determine how far your unit moves, and your unit can end that move as close as possible to the closest objective marker (instead of as close as possible to the closest enemy unit]. All other rules for making <b>surge moves</b> still apply.
TYR|PRESERVATION IMPERATIVE|000008409007|Unending Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Unending Swarm|000000770|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Endless Multitude unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, your unit is treated as containing fewer than five models for the purpose of the [BLAST] ability.
TYR|UNENDING WAVES|000008409003|Unending Swarm – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Unending Swarm|000000770|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Endless Multitude unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> Any destroyed Character units that were attached to your unit are not returned. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.
TYR|ASSASSIN BEASTS|000008418003|Vanguard Onslaught – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Vanguard Onslaught|000000772|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Vanguard Invader Infantry unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PRECISION] ability.
TYR|SURPRISE ASSAULT|000008418002|Vanguard Onslaught – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Vanguard Onslaught|000000772|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after a Vanguard Invader unit from your army has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">VANGUARD</span> <span class="kwb">INVADER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one enemy unit that was selected as the target of one or more of your unit’s attacks. That enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll. If the Battle-shock test was failed, add 1 to the Wound roll as well.
TYR|UNSEEN LURKERS|000008418006|Vanguard Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Vanguard Onslaught|000000772|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Vanguard Invader unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18" or, if your unit has the Lone Operative ability, if the attacking model is within 6". Your opponent can select new targets for the attacking unit’s attacks.
TYR|INVISIBLE HUNTER|000008418007|Vanguard Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Vanguard Onslaught|000000772|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two Vanguard Invader units from your army, or one Tyranids Infantry unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove the targeted units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> The targeted units must be more than 3" away from all enemy units.
TYR|SEEDED BROODS|000008418004|Vanguard Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Vanguard Onslaught|000000772|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">TYRANIDS</span> unit from your army that is in Reserves, or up to two Vanguard Invader units from your army that are in Reserves.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, for the purposes of setting up those selected units on the battlefield, treat the current battle round number as being one higher than it actually is.
TYR|HYPERSENSORY SCILLIA|000008418005|Vanguard Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|2|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Vanguard Onslaught|000000772|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> Up to two Vanguard Invader units from your army that are within 8" of that enemy unit, or one other Tyranids Infantry unit from your army that is within 8" of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Those selected units can each make a Normal move of up to 6".<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot target units that are within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.
TYR|PARASITIC PAYLOAD|000009738004|Warrior Bioform Onslaught Stratagem|1|Your turn|Shooting phase|Warrior Bioform Onslaught|000000982|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase, when a friendly TYRANID WARRIORS unit is selected to shoot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TYRANID</span> <span class="kwb">WARRIORS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s ranged attacks have [IGNORE COVER].
TYR|SYNAPTIC MICRONODES|000009738003|Warrior Bioform Onslaught Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Warrior Bioform Onslaught|000000982|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One friendly TYRANID WARRIORS unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective your unit is controlling. That <b>objective</b> is secured.
TYR|ALIEN PHYSIOLOGY|000009738002|Warrior Bioform Onslaught Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Warrior Bioform Onslaught|000000982|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly TYRANID WARRIORS unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TYRANID</span> <span class="kwb">WARRIORS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Attacks that target your unit with a <b>S</b> greater than your unit’s <b>T</b> have -1 to wound rolls.
WE|FRENZIED RESILIENCE|000008431004|Berzerker Warband – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Berzerker Warband|000000777|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.
WE|HACK AND SLASH|000008431003|Berzerker Warband – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Berzerker Warband|000000777|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase and that made a charge move this turn.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in your unit by 1.
WE|BLOOD OFFERING|000008431002|Berzerker Warband – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Berzerker Warband|000000777|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters unit from your army that was just destroyed while it was within range of one or more objective markers you controlled at the end of the previous phase. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one of those objective markers. That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
WE|SKULLS FOR THE SKULL THRONE!|000008431005|Berzerker Warband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Berzerker Warband|000000777|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after a <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit from your army destroys a <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> or <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> model.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That World Eaters unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Make a Blessings of Khorne roll and use the results to activate one Blessing of Khorne. Until the end of the battle round, that Blessing of Khorne is active in addition to any other Blessings of Khorne that are currently active.
WE|APOPLECTIC FRENZY|000008431006|Berzerker Warband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Berzerker Warband|000000777|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a <span class="kwb">KHORNE</span> <span class="kwb">BERZERKERS</span> unit from your army is selected to Advance.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That Khorne Berzerkers unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.
WE|BERZERKER’S WRATH|000008431007|Berzerker Warband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Berzerker Warband|000000777|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One KHORNE BERZERKERS unit from your army that can make a surge move as a result of those attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Do not roll a D6 to determine how far models in your unit can move when they make a surge move. Instead, when making a surge move, those models can move up to 8".
WE|SAVAGE RESILIENCE|000009709004|Boarding Butchers – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Boarding Butchers|000000977|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.
WE|COWARDS’ BANE|000009709005|Boarding Butchers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Boarding Butchers|000000977|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit is selected to Fall Back.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit from your army (excluding JAKHAL units) within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time that enemy unit Falls Back, models in it must take Desperate Escape tests as if their unit was Battle-shocked. When doing so, if that enemy unit is also Battle-shocked by other means, subtract 1 from each of those Desperate Escape tests.
WE|UNSTOPPABLE RAGE|000009709003|Boarding Butchers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Boarding Butchers|000000977|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, just after a <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit from your army (excluding <span class="kwb">JAKHAL</span> units) opens a Hatchway.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> For each enemy unit within 3" of that Hatchway and wholly on the opposite side of it from your unit, until the start of your next Movement phase, that enemy unit is stunned. While a unit is stunned, each time a model in it makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.
WE|TERRIFYING SCREAMS|000009709002|Boarding Butchers – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Boarding Butchers|000000977|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after a <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit from your army destroys an enemy unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of your opponent’s next Command phase, subtract 1 from Battle-shock and Leadership tests taken for all enemy units.
WE|APOPLECTIC CLARITY|000010977002|Brazen Engines Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Brazen Engines|000001178|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly DAEMON VEHICLE unit is selected to attack.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DAEMON</span> <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks can ignore modifiers to:<br><ul><li><b>BS</b>.</li><li><b>WS</b>.</li><li>Hit rolls and wound rolls.</li></ul>
WE|GOADED TO FURY|000010977004|Brazen Engines Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Brazen Engines|000001178|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged DAEMON VEHICLE unit (excluding TITANIC units) has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DAEMON</span> <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can make a surge move of up to D6".
WE|TRAIL OF DESTRUCTION|000010977003|Brazen Engines Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Brazen Engines|000001178|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase, when a friendly DAEMON VEHICLE unit is selected to move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">DAEMON</span> <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has MOBILE.
WE|WRATH BEYOND REASON|000010981004|Butchers of Khorne Stratagem|2|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Butchers of Khorne|000001179|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting Phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly TERMINATOR SQUAD unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TERMINATOR</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 <b>D</b> until that enemy unit has attacked.
WE|A TROPHY FOR THE THRONE|000010981003|Butchers of Khorne Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Butchers of Khorne|000001179|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly TERMINATOR SQUAD unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TERMINATOR</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s attacks that target a <span class="kwb">MONSTER/VEHICLE</span> unit have +1 to wound rolls.
WE|FOCUSED FEROCITY|000010981002|Butchers of Khorne Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Butchers of Khorne|000001179|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly TERMINATOR SQUAD unit is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">TERMINATOR</span> <span class="kwb">SQUAD</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s melee attacks have +1 <b>A</b>.
WE|BLOODTHIRSTY HORDE|000010075005|Cult of Blood – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Cult of Blood|000001042|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Jakhals or Goremongers unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase and is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your unit is selected to fight, when determining which models in it are eligible to fight, any models in your unit that are within 3" of one or more enemy models are eligible to fight. When resolving those attacks, such models can target one of those enemy units that is within 3" of them and within Engagement Range of their unit.
WE|BRAZEN IDOL|000010075007|Cult of Blood – Epic Deed Stratagem|2|Your turn|Command phase|Cult of Blood|000001042|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Monster or World Eaters Titanic unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select the Idol of Infinite Rage, Idol of Burning Wrath or Idol of Blessed Blood. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Idols of Khorne ability is active for your unit instead of any other Idols of Khorne ability that is active for your army, even if you have already selected that ability this battle.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.
WE|BLOODY VENGEANCE|000010075002|Cult of Blood – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Cult of Blood|000001042|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Monster or World Eaters Titanic unit from your army that was just destroyed by an enemy unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the battle, each time a model in a Jakhals or Goremongers unit from your army makes an attack that targets the enemy unit that just destroyed your unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll.
WE|DRAWN TO THE SLAUGHTER|000010075003|Cult of Blood – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Cult of Blood|000001042|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Jakhals unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed Character units to Attached units. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.
WE|IN THE SHADOW OF BRASS IDOLS|000010075004|Cult of Blood – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Cult of Blood|000001042|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Jakhals or Goremongers unit from your army that was selected as the target as one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability. If your unit is within 6" of one or more friendly World Eaters Monster units, or within 9" of one or more friendly World Eaters Titanic units, your unit has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability instead.
WE|FAIL NOT THE BLOOD GOD|000010075006|Cult of Blood – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Cult of Blood|000001042|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Jakhals or Goremongers unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If that model’s unit is within 6" of one or more friendly World Eaters Monster units, or within 9" of one or more friendly World Eaters Titanic units, you can re-roll the Hit roll instead.
WE|SMASH THROUGH|000010087003|Goretrack Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Goretrack Onslaught|000001045|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Vehicle model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes a Normal or Advance move, it can move horizontally through terrain features.
WE|FULL-THROTTLE ASSAULT|000010087005|Goretrack Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Goretrack Onslaught|000001045|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Rhino model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit disembarks from that model after it has made a Normal move, that unit makes an assault disembark move (Core Rules, 18.06) for that disembarkation.
WE|UNRELENTING ADVANCE|000010087006|Goretrack Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Goretrack Onslaught|000001045|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Vehicle model from your army that was hit by one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your model can make a Normal move of up to 6".<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> A unit cannot be targeted by this Stratagem and the Fury Unleashed Stratagem in the same phase.
WE|AGGRESSIVE DISEMBARKATION|000010087004|Goretrack Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Goretrack Onslaught|000001045|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Rhino model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> One <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit embarked within your <span class="kwb">RHINO</span> can disembark. When doing so, models in that unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 6" of your <span class="kwb">RHINO</span> and can be set up within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.
WE|ENDLESS PURSUIT OF VIOLENCE|000010087002|Goretrack Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Goretrack Onslaught|000001045|<b>WHEN:</b> End of the Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Infantry unit from your army and one friendly Transport that it is able to embark within.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> If your <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> <span class="kwb">INFANTRY</span> unit is wholly within 6" of that <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span>, it can embark within it.
WE|FURY UNLEASHED|000010087007|Goretrack Onslaught – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Shooting phase|Goretrack Onslaught|000001045|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One WORLD EATERS RHINO model from your army that has one or more wounds remaining and was hit by one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> One KHORNE BERZERKERS unit embarked within your model can make a disembark move and then make a surge move of up to D6+2".<br><br><b>RESTRICTION:</b> A unit cannot be targeted by this Stratagem and the Unrelenting Advance Stratagem in the same phase.
WE|BLESSING OF BURNING BLOOD|000010079005|Khorne Daemonkin – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Khorne Daemonkin|000001043|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Blood Legions unit from your army that is within 6" of a friendly World Eaters unit that was selected as the target as one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, models in your <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit have a 5+ invulnerable save. If the Boon of Blood ability is active for your army, then until the end of the phase, models in your <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit have a 4+ invulnerable save.
WE|DAEMONIC FURY|000010079003|Khorne Daemonkin – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Khorne Daemonkin|000001043|<b>WHEN:</b> Start of your Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Blood Legions unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one friendly World Eaters unit within 6" of your unit. Until the end of the turn, melee weapons equipped by models in your <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit have the [LANCE] ability. If the Daemonic Rage ability is active for your army, then until the end of the phase those melee weapons also have the [TWIN-LINKED] ability.
WE|A WORTHY SKULL|000010079004|Khorne Daemonkin – Epic Deed Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Khorne Daemonkin|000001043|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after a Blood Legions or World Eaters unit from your army has fought, and one or more enemy <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> or <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> models were destroyed as a result of those attacks.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">BLOOD</span> <span class="kwb">LEGIONS</span> or <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> You gain D3BTP and you can then spend one or more BTP you have to activate one of the Blood Tithe abilities.<br>
WE|MURDER-CALL|000010079007|Khorne Daemonkin – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Fight phase|Khorne Daemonkin|000001043|<b>WHEN:</b> End of your opponent’s Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Blood Legions unit from your army that is on the battlefield and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.
WE|DAEMONTIDE|000010079006|Khorne Daemonkin – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Command phase|Khorne Daemonkin|000001043|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one friendly Blood Legions unit within 6" of your unit. One destroyed Mounted model, up to D3 destroyed Beast models, or up to D6 destroyed Infantry models are returned to that <span class="kwb">BLOOD</span> <span class="kwb">LEGIONS</span> unit with their full wounds remaining.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed Character models to Attached units.
WE|SUMMONED BY SLAUGHTER|000010079002|Khorne Daemonkin – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Khorne Daemonkin|000001043|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when the last model in a unit is destroyed, before removing it from play. (If that unit is a Transport, any units embarked within that <span class="kwb">TRANSPORT</span> model must disembark first.)<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Bloodletters unit from your army that is in Reserves.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Set your unit up anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 9" of that destroyed model and more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy units, then remove the destroyed model from play.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You cannot use this Stratagem more than once per battle round.
WE|DAEMONIC RESISTANCE|000010083002|Possessed Slaughterband – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Shooting or Fight phase|Possessed Slaughterband|000001044|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Possessed unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.
WE|DAEMONIC STRENGTH|000010083003|Possessed Slaughterband – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Possessed Slaughterband|000001044|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Possessed unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an attack made by a model in your unit is allocated to an enemy model, if your unit has the Eightbound keyword and that enemy model is not a <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> or <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span>, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack. If your unit has the Exalted Eightbound keyword and that enemy model is a <span class="kwb">MONSTER</span> or <span class="kwb">VEHICLE</span>, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack instead.
WE|IMMORTAL FURY|000010083004|Possessed Slaughterband – Battle Tactic Stratagem|2|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Possessed Slaughterband|000001044|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Possessed unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.
WE|RAPID MANIFESTATION|000010083005|Possessed Slaughterband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement phase|Possessed Slaughterband|000001044|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Exalted Eightbound unit from your army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6" horizontally away from all enemy units.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> A unit targeted with this Stratagem is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn.
WE|WARP STALKERS|000010083006|Possessed Slaughterband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Possessed Slaughterband|000001044|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Possessed unit from your army that has not been selected to move or declare a charge this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move, it can move through enemy models (excluding <span class="kwb">MONSTERS</span> and <span class="kwb">VEHICLES</span>). When doing so, it can move within Engagement Range of such models but, unless that move was a Charge move, it cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed.
WE|HORRIFYING VIOLENCE|000010083007|Possessed Slaughterband – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Command phase|Possessed Slaughterband|000001044|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One World Eaters Possessed unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Each enemy unit within Engagement Range of your unit must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from that test.
WE|SHOCKING ONSLAUGHT|000009717005|Skullsworn – Battle Tactic Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement or Charge phase|Skullsworn|000000978|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement or Charge phase, just after an enemy unit is selected to fire Overwatch.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy unit is selected to fire Overwatch, it must take a Leadership test, subtracting 1 from the result: if failed, that enemy unit cannot fire Overwatch at your unit this phase.
WE|BLOOD RITE|000009717002|Skullsworn – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Skullsworn|000000978|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, just after a WORLD EATERS TERMINATOR, EIGHTBOUND or EXALTED EIGHTBOUND unit from your army destroys an enemy unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Select one objective marker that your unit or the destroyed unit was within range of at the start of the phase. That objective marker is Secured by your army.
WE|FURIOUS MOMENTUM|000009717003|Skullsworn – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Skullsworn|000000978|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6" instead of up to 3".
WE|RUINOUS RAMPAGE|000009717004|Skullsworn – Strategic Ploy Stratagem|1|Your turn|Movement or Charge phase|Skullsworn|000000978|<b>WHEN:</b> Your Movement or Charge phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One WORLD EATERS TERMINATOR, EIGHTBOUND or EXALTED EIGHTBOUND unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase and has not declared a charge this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, when making a Normal, Advance or Charge move, your unit can move through a single closed Hatchway as if it was open. When doing so, that Hatchway is opened and cannot be closed for the rest of the battle. This can allow that unit to declare a charge against enemy units that are not visible to it, but to do so those enemy units must be within 1" of that Hatchway and wholly on the opposite side of it from your unit.<br><br><b>RESTRICTIONS:</b> You can only use this Stratagem once per turn.
WE|SCORN THE WITCH|000009848002|Vessels of Wrath Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Any phase|Vessels of Wrath|000001007|<b>WHEN:</b> Any phase, when a friendly WORLD EATERS CHARACTER unit (excluding EPIC HERO units) suffers a mortal wound.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit has Feel No Pain 4+ against mortal wounds.
WE|ASPIRE TO INFAMY|000009848003|Vessels of Wrath Stratagem|1|Either player’s turn|Fight phase|Vessels of Wrath|000001007|<b>WHEN:</b> Fight phase, when a friendly WORLD EATERS CHARACTER unit (excluding EPIC HERO units) is selected to fight.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Your unit’s <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> models’ melee attacks have:<br><ul><li>+1 <b>A</b>.</li><li>+2 <b>S</b>.</li></ul>
WE|PUNISH THE CRAVEN|000009848004|Vessels of Wrath Stratagem|1|Opponent’s turn|Movement phase|Vessels of Wrath|000001007|<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Movement phase, when a unit is selected to make a fall-back move, if that unit is engaged with a friendly WORLD EATERS CHARACTER unit.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> That <span class="kwb">WORLD</span> <span class="kwb">EATERS</span> <span class="kwb">CHARACTER</span> unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> When an enemy unit <b>engaged</b> with your unit is selected to make a <b>fall-back move</b>, that enemy unit must use the desperate escape mode. If that enemy unit is battle-shocked, -1 from those hazard rolls.
